<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Gwandara</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Manki te Anya LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Manki te Anya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Kiya Beta</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Manki te anya Luka </char> Nana Yesu te anya anikowori Sila ni Izireyila nja nsu Sila ni ntani guru. <char style="bk">Luka</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kiya beta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ntani nyowa su yi kokori de su rubuta manki a kiya mbode paru a sisika amu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Su rubuta mbo mu yiride mu zi anya worede su ma dege pari su geni a ndani asu su yi doka manki Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nkayomu, tolense Tiyopolu, eni nkiya na ni bishinkye guru mbode e paru npari, Ni geni e man kyawu de ni rubuta manki mu keyi ke, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />de ki ma tebeshi a kiya ni mbode su kokoyi ke.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su keyi manki yapu Yaaya Nsu tunkwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Kwanki de Yiridu e ma seleki ni Yawudiya, muman Pirisi de seni yi e ma Zakariya, e ma ntani gizi Abija. Seni mata e yi e ma Elisabatu; e shi ma e butu a gizi Aruna. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Guru asu su yi zunwa mere lepi a geba Mirikisi, sua biya doka nja kayida mbode Obagizi pala guru. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Sede Su man yaya ba sobon de Elisabatu e taba yapu ba, guru asu su sopa.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Nana da Zakariya yaa yi ANKI yi ni pirisi, de ANKI juyi zo a tala su, Zakariya yaa yi ANKI e yi a geba Mirikisi, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Su zabi yi sobon alada de su juriya nsu pirisi su biya, de yuru a siki laki lepa ni Obagizi de e yi ayaki nsu kemeshi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Kwanki de Zakariya yaa yi ayaki zo, guru ntani nyowa tala sua yi lepa a woze.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Se Meleku Mirikisi butu ta anya yi, sakisi a keteri nani dama ni anya beyi sedeka anya de sua yi ayaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />De Zakariya geni Meleku Mirikisi, e nyanji se womba keyi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Sede meleku Obagizi gye yi nkye: &lt;&lt;Kede ki zi womba, Zakariya; su zi lepa ake. Mata ake Elisabatu yaa man siki yaa yapu ke yaa minzi, ka beyi seni Yaaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Yaama ke mbo muruna nja perisiki, ntani nyowa sua yi peri siki sobon de su yapu yi, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />yaa ma totolo anya ni Obagizi. Yaa sha giya ko mbode yaa sa bugu ba, sede yaa sika nja Aworo Nsuseki tunde e ma a siki ni Ama yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ntani nyowa ni Izireyila yaa kuman nsu mbayi zo anya Obagizi Mirikisi asu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Yaa rigye Obagizi geba, a siki ni Aworo nja sori ni Iliya, yaa juyi dishiya ni nsu Adaa te anya yaya asu nja juyi worede sua yi lesa zi ta shina zunwa gangasi, de sa ntani sua zunwa nshiri pekye Obagizi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya e minya Meleku ni Obagizi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaya na Na shina nkye ema yomu? Kuzukam ni ma susupe nseminji. Mata na kwa sopa du.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Meleku Obagizi keleba, &lt;&lt;Eni ni ma Gebire. Ni ma sakisi a geba Mirikisi, su saka ni de gye ke beta ni nabari kyakyawu mu. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Se kuzukam ka man shuru ka yi yaa beta gagaba se nana de anikowori mu sika, sobon de ki ki yeda beta na, de yaama gaskye a dede kwanki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Nkaa yomu, ntani su zunwa pekye Zakariya de e butu a siki laki Mirikisi su ma siki mamanki mina sa de e dede a siki laki Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />De Zakariya butu a woze, e yi su beta ba. Se su shina nkye e geni wahayi a siki laki Mirikisi, e ma nana su nani sede e yi beta ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />De kwanki ni yi bowuta e yi yaa, e kuma te a gizi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />A beyi su samu mata e yi Elisabatu e man siki e boyi kiya yi wonta biyari. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />&lt;&lt;Alisabatu nkye,&gt;&gt; Obagizi e yi ni mbo mu. &lt;&lt;A nana mu e nana ni aniyeri e la ni kumnya butu anya ni ntani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Su pala yapu ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />A siki wonta shida, Mirikisi saka meleku seni ma Gebire ta Nazare, a totolo geri ni Galili, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ta anya yaa mase de puari nse minji ba de su yi anikowori de sua yi amere seni yi ma Yusupu, ni gizi Dowuda. Seni ni yaa mase ni ma Meremu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Meleku Mirikisi ta anya yi e gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Gesuwa, e ke de su nana ke aniyeri! Mirikisi e man nja ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Selema de Meremu e zi e suwo yi a dishiya e pala nkye woni yiri gesuwa ma nsu mu. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Sede Meleku Mirikisi gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ki zi womba, Meremu, ki samu aniyeri anya Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ka yi siki de ka yapu yaa minzi, ka sa yi seni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Yaama tolense sua sukwa yi Yaa nsu de man girima. Obagizi Mirikisi yaa beyi kingbolo ni Adaa e yi Dowuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />yaa yi solota gizi ni Yakubu ni gbogbo; solota yi mma ya gagaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Meremu minya Meleku Mirikisi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaya na mbo mu yaama yomu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tunde ni puari nseminji ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Meleku Mirikisi keleba yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Aworo Nsuseki yaa sonka a kiya ake, sori ni nsu de pi girima yaa ripe ke. Sobon yomu Yaa nsuseki de sua yapu yi mu sua sukwa yi nkye Yaa Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Ko Elisabatu yayiwa ake a siki sopa yi yaa mani yaa, e shi de su nkye e ma awari mase de taba yapu ba e man siki wonta shida. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Mbodaa ma de yaa gagara Mirikisi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />&lt;&lt;Eni ni ma bunwa Mirikisi la,&gt;&gt; Meremu keleba nkye. &lt;Emayomu yiride ki pala.&gt;&gt; Se meleku Mirikisi bila yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meremu Te anya Alisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />A kwanki ni Meremu yi shiri; seseberi te a geri de ma ogbo ni Yawudiya, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Anya ni de e yuru a gizi ni Zakariya e geshe Elisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />De Elisabatu zi gesuwa ni Meremu se yaa yi moshi asikye yi, se Alisabatu sika ni Aworo nsuseki. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Elisabatu yi kuruwa ni totolo murinya nkye: &lt;&lt;Ki ma nsu anabirika la a siki mata, yaa de ka yapu ema nsu anabirika na! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Sede mina sa de ni ma nsu aniyeri, de amaa ni Obagizi na e zo anyana? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />De ni zi murinya gesuwa ake a kuni na, yaa de ma siki na e yi moshi ni peri siki. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Anabirika ema nsu de yeda ni mbode Obagizi pala gye yi yaa shika!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wonka ni Meremu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Se Meremu nkye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Dishiya na yaa yobo Obagizi<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Bila de aworo na yi perisiki nja Mirikisi nsu sila ni,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />sobon e turunwa nni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">kode nkye ni ma bunwa yi de ma mbodaa ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Dege kuzukam te a geba guru ntani sua sukwa ni nkye nsu anabirika,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />sobon Mirikisi nsu girima yi ni mbo totolo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">seni yi ema nsuseki.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Toseyi yi ema nja worede sua zi womba yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">butu a sana ta sana.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />E yi mbo nsu girima ni nani yi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">e kula nsu dege dolo a siki dishiya asu.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />E sonka seleki a kingbolo solota asu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">sede e dege worede la kiya asu ma mbodaa ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />E sika nsu zi nyunwa ni mbo kyakyawu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">nsu nani e seleme su ni nnani kwakwani.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />E sua bunwa yi Izireyila nto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">e turunwa ni ntani yi de yi su aniyeri<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />te anya ni Abireyi nja ntani yi ni gbogbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">ko yiride e gye nsu Adaatolo amu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Meremu ma nja Alisabatu ni wonta wuku tuku e kuma ta gizi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">yapu Ni Yaaya Nsu Tunkwasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />De kwanki ni Elisabatu yi de yaa yapu yaa e yi, e yapu yaa minzi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Dengeri yi nja dengi su zi nkye Obagizi nana yi aniyeri totolo, su yi peri siki beyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Nana ni takusi su zo de su yi yaa yanka, su bila de su sa yi seni ni adaa yi Zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />sede amaa yi gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ayi! Sua sukwa yi nkye Yaaya na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Su gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Nseda a siki dengi ake e man seni mu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Se su yi adaa ni yaa ni beta nnani, de e gye su seni de sua saa yaa ni. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />E minya asu nkye su ba yi teburu dende de e rubutu, se e rubuta seni yi nkye Yaaya, &lt;&lt;Guru ntani de su ma anya ni su yi mamanki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Dandani baki Zakariya bure yi beta, e yi wonka yobo Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Dengeri de su ma anya ni guru su yi Womba, ntani su ma pala nabari ni mbode paru guru a kesa ni Yawudiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Guru nsu de zi mbo su yi tunani a dishiya asu kiya yi, e minya nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina na yaa mu yaa ma?&gt;&gt; De nani Obagizi ma kiya yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wonka ni Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Adaa yi Zakariya sika ni Aworo nsuseki yaa yi aneshi:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Yobo te nja Obagizi, Mirikisi ni Izireyila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">sobon e zo de sila ntani yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />E dege nsu sori de sila mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">A gizi ni bunwa yi Dowuda<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ari e pala a baki ni anebi yi nsuseki a kwanki de bise,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />De sila mu anya obokigeba mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">nja anya guru worede sua ki mu<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />sua ta nana aniyeri ba nsu adaatolo amu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">de turunwa ni anikowori yi nsuseki de yi su, <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />melese de yi adaa mu Abireyi:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />de butu mu a nani ni obokigeba amu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">de mu biya yi ba womba<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />De muma nsuseki nja zunwa gangasi anya Mirikisi guru kwanki de muman shi.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />&lt;&lt;Eke, yaa na, sua sukwa ke anebi ni Mirikisi nsu girima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">eke ka te a geba ni Obagizi de ki gyala turiki yi,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />de ki ba ntani yi shina ni sila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">te anya ni yape lepi su,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />sobon yowa ni toseyi Mirikisi mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">nana de yaa zo mu dege bisi<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />sobon de yaa beyi asikye ba worede su ma a siki dopuwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">nja worede ma lelenga ni muntu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">de biya mu a turiki ni selema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Se Yaaya yi girima a siki sori ni aworo; e zunwa a siki denka ari nana de e butu a pili te a Izireyila.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yapu Ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />A kwanki de Seleki Keisa Agustu e beyi doka nkye su kiriga ntani de su ma kesa Roma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Da mu e shiya na ma kiriga ni pari de su yi a kwanki de Kiriniyasu yaa yi solota ni kesa Suriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Se konse kuma ta geri e yi de su kiriga yi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Se Yusupu e shi ma te a geri Nazere a siki Galili ni Yawudiya, ta Batalami geri ni Dowuda, sobon e ma juriya ni Dowuda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Yusupu te anya ni de su kiriga yi nja Meremu mase sari, de su yi anikowori ni amere nja kiya su, kwanki ni Meremu e man siki yaa bila de yapu yaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />De su ma a Batalami, kwanki yi de yaa yapu Yaa yi, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />se e yapu yaa yi ni pari, yaa minji. E ripe yi ni woriki, e la yi kwakwana a mbode sua ba daba mbosi a siki yi, sobon su samu laki de sua sonka a siki yi ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">nsu Kone Daba Nja Meleku Mirikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Anya ni worosu nsu kiwo su ma pili kusa ni anya ni, sua kpanku timshiya asu ndederi. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Se meleku ni Mirikisi zo anya asu, se girima ni Obagizi yi asikye gyewe su, se su zi womba soseyi. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Sede meleku Mirikisi gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ku zi womba. Ni keyi ku nabari kyakyawu ni totolo perisiki anya ni ntani guru. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Yawu a siki geri ni Dowuda su yapu nsu sila ku; e ma Kiristi Obagizi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Da mu e shiya ma alama ba ku: Kwa san yaa dende su lende yi ni keyi su leyi kwakwana a kiya mbode sua baa daba mbosi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Dandani se kunji shoja ni meleku bisi nyowa butu nja meleku sua yobo Mirikisi nkye,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Girima ta anya Mirikisi de ma siki bisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">a durinya selema nja aniyeri ma ba worede Mirikisi yaa zi dadi asu&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />De meleku Mirikisi bila su te a siki bisi, nsu yi kiwo su gye nkyasu, &lt;&lt;Mu te Batalami de mu te geni mbode paru, de Mirikisi yi mu beta a kiya yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Su yi seberi te geni meremu nja Yusupu, ni yaa dende, de kwakwana a kiya anya de sua ba daba mbosi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />De nsu kiwo geni yaa dende ni se su pala nabari de meleku Mirikisi gye su a kiya ni yaa mu, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />guru nsu worede zi su yi mamanki ni mbode nsu kiwo gye su. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Sede Meremu keyi guru mbo de su pala yaa yi tunani a siki dishiya yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Nsu kiwo kuma, su beyi girima nja yobo Mirikisi sobon guru mbode su zi sukwa geni, yiri de ntani gye su.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Bayi Yesu A siki Laki Lepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Nana takusi, de kwanki yi ni yanka, su sa yi seni Yesu, seni de meleku beyi kapi de sua yapu yi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Munka Yesu a Laki Mirikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />De kwanki yi de su wonka rebi yiri de doka ni Musa pala de su yi, Yusupu nja Meremu su la Yesu ta Wurishelima de su munka yi ba Mirikisi <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />E ma meyi yomu na yiri de e rubuta a siki takada doka ni Obagizi, &lt;&lt;Kowoni yaa Minji ni pari de su yapu sua leyi saa keteri ni seki ba Obagizi&gt;&gt;, <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />se su beyi sedeka de ema kyakya nja mbode ma a siki doka Mirikisi: &lt;&lt;Nkurisha bi ko yaya ni tatambiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kuzukam nseminji daa a Wurishelima sua sukwa seni nkye Simiyo, ema nse de yaa yi zunwa gangasi anya Mirikisi nja beyi nki yi ba ANKI Mirikisi. E kwa pekye nana de sua yi takuwa Izireyila, Aworo Nsuseki ma a kiya yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Aworo Nsuseki pelesa gye yi nkye yaa muntu ba se e geni Obagizi Yesu Kiristi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />De e sika nja Aworo ni Mirikisi, e dege te a laki Mirikisi a kwanki de su keyi Yesu te de su yi yiri de alada doka Musa pala nkye su yi, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyo leyi nana yi e yobo Mirikisi, nkye:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Mirikisi nsu girima, yiri de ki yi anikowori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ki seleme bunwa ke a siki selema.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Sobon ndani na geni sila ake,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />de ki gyala ba ntani guru,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />asikye de yaa pelesa ake ba ntani worede su ma Yawudawa ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">nja girima ba ntani ake Izireyila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Adaa nja Amaa ni Yesu su ka nani a baki, su yi mamanki ni mbode Simiyo pala a kiya ni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Se Simiyo sa su anabirika e gye Meremu Amaa yi nkye: &lt;&lt;Mirikisi zabi Yaa mu de ma puari ni woron su nja dege ni woron su a Izireyila, nja de yaama alama de ntani sua yi geba nja shi, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />de tunani dishiya asu yaa pelesa asu. Mbo mu yaa suwo ke a dishiya kankye su sukwa ke tokopi dishiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Anya ni anebi ni mase, sua sukwa yi Anatu, ema yaa mase Adaa yi ma Panuwe, e ma juriya ni Asha. E sopa soseyi; E yi zunwa ni amere shekera bokwe kya, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Anya ni mase makeyi ma de e yi shekera tamani ni wuru de ma laki Mirikisi e butu ba, yaa bowuta Mirikisi kowon nana ndederi nja nnana, yaa yi azimi nja lepa. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Anatu zo anya su kwanki ni, yaa gbede Mirikisi yi beta a kiya ni yaa ni nja guru worede sua san ndani sigeba ni sila Wurishelima.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kuma ta Nazere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />De Yusupu nja Meremu su yi guru mbo de doka Mirikisi nkye su yi, su kuma ma su ta Galili geri asu ni Nazere. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Yesu yi girima e kwa yi; e sika nja shina, nja aniyeri ni Mirikisi e ma a kiya yi.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ma Gizi Mirikisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kowoni shekera Adaa nja Amaa ni Yesu sua ta Wurishelima de su yi buki ni nyenteri. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />De Yesu yi shekera gom sha bi ni girima, su te ayan buki, yiri alada de su saba yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />A beyi de buki yaa, de nsu adaa yi sua kuma ta gizi, Yesu Amaa yi a Wurishelima, sede su shina de sakisi ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Sua geni kankye ema nja su yi tepiya ni nana daa. Se su para bila yi a siki yayuwa su nja nsu oboki asu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />De su geni yi ba, su kuma mbayi te a Wurishelima te Bele yi. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />A beyi nana wuku su geni yi a siki laki Mirikisi, zunwa a sisika nsu male, yaa zi su e kwa minya su beta. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Guru nsude zi yi su yi mamanki ni yiri shina ni Yesu nja keleba de yaa yi su. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />De nsu Adaa yi su geni yi, su yi mamanki. Amaa yi gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaa na, mina sa de ki yi mu yomu? Adaa ake nja Ni mu rikishe de mu geni ke ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />&lt;&lt;Yesu minya su nkye, Mina sa de kwa bilani?&gt;&gt; Ku shina nkye e yi kyawu de Ni ma gizi Adaa na bo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Sede su shina mbode yaa gye su ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />E beyi girima e te a Nazere nja su. Amaa yi keyi beta mu a siki dishiya yi yaa yi tunani. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Se Yesu yi girima a nki nja a siki simi, e kuma man peri zini anya Mirikisi nja ntani.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yaaya nsu Tunkwasa Gyala Turiki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />A siki shekera gom sha biyari ni solota ni kesa Tiberiya de Buntu Bilatu yaa yi solota ni Yawudiya. Yiridu yaa yi solota ni Galili, yayiwa e yi Pilibu yaa yi solota ni Ituriya nja Tarakunita, nja Lisaniya yaa yi solota ni Abiliya, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Kwanki de Ananiya nja kayapa su ma toree ni pirisi, beta Mirikisi zo anya ni Yaaya yaa ni Zakariya a siki denka. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yaaya te a siki guru geri de gyewe baki riki ni Wurudu, yaa beyi manki tunkwasa ni juyi bila lepi nja sobon yape ni lepi su. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />E ma rubuta a siki takada Ishaya anebi Mirikisi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Murinya daa nsu sukwa a siki denka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Gyala turiki ba Obagizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Ku munka turiki tiriri beyi.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kowoni gbongbolo sua sika yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">kowoni dunsi nja ogbo sua ku ma nshi kwana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">turiki de tonkori sua munka yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">turiki de ma mumungu sua gyale yi.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Guru ntani beki sua geni sila Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yaaya gye ntani de su butu zo de yi su tunkwasa, &lt;&lt;Oku yaya ni ogbozi! Waa gila ku de ku yi gudu bila mungu mbode yaa san ku? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ku yi mbode nana nkye ku juyi bila mbo mumungu. Kede ku nkye, &lt;Kuma ni Abireyi e ma adaa ku.&gt; Mma gye ku Mirikisi yaa yi yaa juyi dunsi de su ma yaya Abireyi. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ko kuzukam gapiya Obagizi e ma kisi ririnya ntasi, kowoni ntasi de yaa yapu yaya kyakyawu ba, sua sala e yi kutiri a siki wuta.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />&lt;&lt;Ntani minya yi nkye. Mina mua yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yaaya keleba, &lt;&lt;Nsu de man riga bi e laba nja nsude e man shi ba, nsude mani mbosi e yi yomu du.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nsu keleba gendu osu ma su zo de su yi tunkwasa. Su minya nkye, &lt;&lt;Male,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mina mua yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Kede ku keleba Nyowa pi yiride su sa ku,&gt;&gt; E gye su.<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Se worosu su shoja su minya yi, &lt;&lt;Mina mua yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">E keleba su nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ku ka ntani nsori de su ba ku gyolo nja kede ku basi ntani nlepi de su yi ba, ku gbede ni mbode sua biya ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Ntani sua pekye se guru asu sua yi mamanki a dishiya asu su nkye ko Yaaya e shiya ma kiristi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yaaya keleba su guru, &lt;&lt;Na yi ku tunkwasa ni riki. Sede nse daa de ma totolo pi ni yaa zo, ni deta de na konse angwe takalami yi ba. E shi yaa yi ku tunkwasa ni Aworo Nsuseki nja wuta. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />E keyi tengeri yi a nani de yaa dukwa saba a pita nja sheke nyanye butu a siki saba, Anya ni yaa tala saba arigogo yi, akweyi nyanye si wuta a wuta de yaa muntu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />A turiki nyowa Yaaya beyi nabari kyakyawu te nja ntani nja gila su de su juyi bila lepi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Sede Yaaya kwabe gomuna Yiridu sobon e yi kyawu ba de ki bila Yirudiya mata yayiwa yi Pilibu, nja guru mungu mbode e yi, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Yiridu sa su kaa Yaaya kule laki jaru: da mu e shina ma mungu mbo de yi jaja.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaaya Yi Yesu Tunkwasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />De guru ntani su yi tunkwasa, Yesu e shi ma yi tunkwasa du. De yaa yi lepa, se bisi bure <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Aworo nsuseki sonka a kiya e yi ni nki kankye nkurisha. Anya ni su zi murinya butu dege A bisi nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki ma Yaa na la, de E ni ma so; nja e ke na yi peri siki soseyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsu Adaatolo ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Kuzum Yesu nkiya e yi man shekera talatin kapi de e para ANKI ni kokoyi ntani. ntani yi tunani nkye e ma Yaa, ni Yusupu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yaa ni Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Yusupu Yaa ni Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Mattat yaa ni Lawi, yaa ni Malki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">yaa ni Yanna, Yaa ni Yusupu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusupu ma Yaa ni Matatiya, yaa ni Amosi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">yaa ni Nahu, yaa ni Asili,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">yaa ni Najaya,<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />yaa ni Maata, yaa ni Matasiya, yaa ni Semina,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semina yaa ni Yosiki, Yosiki yaa ni Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda yaa ni Yowana,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Yowana yaa ni Resa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa yaa ni Zerubabe,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Zerubabe yaa ni Sheyatiye,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Sheyatiye yaa ni Neri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri yaa ni Maliki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Maliki yaa ni Addi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Addi yaa ni kosama,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosama yaa ni Elimadama,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Elimadama yaa ni Er,<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er yaa ni Yoshuwa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yoshuwa yaa ni Eliyaza,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyaza yaa ni Yorim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Yorim yaa ni Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Mattat yaa ni Lawi<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi yaa ni Simiyo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simiyo yaa ni Juda,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Juda yaa ni Yusupu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yusupu yaa ni Yonam,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonam yaa ni Eliyaki,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyaki yaa ni Malaya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Malaya yaa ni Mena,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mena yaa ni Matata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Matata yaa ni Nata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Nata yaa ni Dowuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dowuda Yaa ni Yesi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">yaa ni Obadiya, yaa ni Boaza,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">yaa ni Salmon yaa ni Nashon,<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon yaa ni Aminada,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aminada yaa ni Aram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aram yaa ni Yezron,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Yezron yaa ni Periza,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Periza yaa ni Yawuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yawuda yaa ni Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakubu yaa ni Ishaku,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ishaku yaa ni Abireyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abireyi yaa ni Tera,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Tera yaa ni Nahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor yaa ni Serug,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Serugu yaa ni Reyu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reyu yaa ni Pelegi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Pelegi yaa ni Eber,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eber yaa ni Shela <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela yaa ni Kena,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kena yaa ni Apasha,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Apasha yaa ni Shem,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shem yaa ni Nuwu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Nuwu yaa ni Lame, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lame yaa ni Metusela,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Metusela yaa ni Enoku,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enoku yaa ni Yare,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Yare yaa ni Mahalalele,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalale yaa ni Kena, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kena yaa ni Enoshi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enoshi yaa ni Seti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Seti yaa ni Adomu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adomu de Mirikisi alita e yi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mungu Nse Gwadaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mk 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />De Yesu, sika ni Aworo ni Mirikisi, kuma dege a totolo riki ni Yoda Aworo ni Mirikisi biya nshi butu te a denka, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />anya de obiri gwada e yi nana aribeyi. A siki nana mu e si mbodaa ba, se a karishe e zi nyunwa.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Obiri pala gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde ki ma yaa ni Mirikisi, gye dunsi mu de e ma mbosi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;E rubuta a siki takada Mirikisi: &lt;Nsebeki yaama leyi sobon mbosi kede ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Anya ni obiri biya Yesu te bisi nyisa e nana e yi guru solota ni durinya. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Obiri gye Yesu, &lt;&lt;Na ba ke guru yiko asu nja girima asu, guru mbo mu su la ba ni, e ni Na baa du nsu de Na so. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nde ki bowuta, guru yaa ma na ke.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt;E ma rubuta a siki takada Mirikisi, ki bowuta Obagizi Mirikisi e ke de ki bowuta yi eshi ndandaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Se anya ni obiri biya Yesu te Wurishelima E sa yi sakisi a kiya bisi gizi Mirikisi. E gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde ki ma yaa Mirikisi,&gt;&gt; tirimi nki e ke de ki zo a kisi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />E ma rubuta a siki takada Mirikisi nkye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;&lt;&lt;Mirikisi yaa beyi doka ba Meleku yi sobon e ke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">sua zo de su tengele ke nkyawu;<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />sua la ke a bisi a nani asu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">kede seni e ke e buga adunsi ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt;Nkye su rubuta a takada: &lt;Kede ki gwada Obagizi Mirikisi ake ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />De obiri gama gwada yi guru kwanki piri mu se e bila e yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Para Anki a Galili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mk 1.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Se Yesu kuma te Galili a siki sori ni Aworo ni Mirikisi, se nabari e yi gyewe anya guru keteri kesa ni. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />E kokoyi a siki kolonwa su, kowoni nse sua yobo yi.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su ki Yesu a Nazere</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Se Yesu te a Nazere, anya de e yi girima a siki e yi, se a nana ni asibi e te a siki kolonwa, yiri de e saba te. Se e dege a bisi de e karanta. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Su beyi takada ni anebi Ishaya anebi. De bure yi, e geni anya de su rubuta nkye:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Aworo ni Mirikisi e ma nja ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">sobon e shapa ni meyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">de ni beyi nabari kyakyawu ba worede ma potoruwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">E saka ni de ni yi doka ni kunshe nsu worede ma jaru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nja de makapi su samu geni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">de su sika worede sua girika su,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />de Ni yi doka ba ntani a kiya kwanki de Mirikisi yaa yi ntani aniyeri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Se e lende takada, e kuma nshi ba nsu worede sua geni laki Mirikisi se zuzunwa kisi. Guru ntani de ma kolonwa lepa su kapa Yesu ndani, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />se Yesu sigeba ngye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Yawumu takada Mirikisi de su rubuta sika yiri de kwa zi,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Guru asu su beyi sheeda kyakyawu a kiya yi nja su yi mamanki kelima kyakyawu de butu arishiya yi. Su minya nkye. &lt;&lt;Damu na ema yaa Yusupu ni bo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ni shina kwa gye ni keri beta mu: &lt;Nsu megeni, ki worikye nkiya ke! Ki yi anya a geri ke mbode mu zi nkye ki yi a siki Kapanawu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />&lt;&lt;Na gye ku gaskye,&gt;&gt; e si geba, &lt;&lt;Ntani sua taba keleba manki ni anebi Mirikisi a geri e yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Na gye ku gaskye a kwanki ni anebi Iliya muma mata makeyi nyowa de minji su muntu a Izireyila, de riki ni Mirikisi sakisi ni shekera wuku nja wonta shida, de su yi totolo nyunwa a guru a kesa ni. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Du yomu su saka Iliya anya nse daa a siki asu ba, sede anya ni mase makeyi de ma a Zarepa dege Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />A kwanki ni Elesha anebi muman kputuru Nyowa a Izireyila, ba nseda a siki asu de samu worikye ba, se Naama ni kesa Suriya kede.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Guru ntani de su ma kolonwa su yi anwashi de su zi mbode Yesu pala. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Su dege a bisi, su jaa Yesu butu a woze totolo geri, su keyi ta a kiya totolo ogbo de su gini geri asu a siki e yi, de su kiri yi puari butu a kiya ogbo. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Sede Yesu yi tepiya a siki nyowa ntani e te meyi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nseminji Nsu Mungu Aworo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Se Yesu te a Kapanawu, geri a siki Galili, a nana asibi yaa kokoyi ntani.<verse eid="LUK 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Mbode yaa kokoyi su ba su mamanki, sobon manki e yi e man yiko.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />A siki kolonwa lepa yaa minzi daa e ma anya ni de e man aworo nsu dola, nja mumungu aworo. E yi kuruwa nja totolo murinya, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;wululu! Mina ka bila nja mu, Yesu ni Nazere? Ki zo de ki kisa mu? Ni shina waa ma e ke, nsuseki ni Mirikisi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />&lt;&lt;Yesu kwabe mungu aworo nkye!&gt;&gt; Yi shuru. &lt;&lt;Ki butu Bele yi&gt;&gt; Se mumungu aworo e la nse ni buga a kisi a geba asu se butu bila e yi e zi suwo ba.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Guru ntani su yi mamanki su gye nkiasu, &lt;&lt;Mina da mu yaa kokoyi mu? nja yiko nja nana girima de yaa gye mungu aworo de sua butu a woze!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Se nabari a kiya mbode Yesu yi kakada anya guru.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Worikye Ntani Nyowa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1.29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu bila siki kolonwa e te a gizi ni Sima. Amaa ni mata Sima yaa yi suwo ni mashapo, se su gye Yesu de worikye yi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Se Yesu jaa kusa anya de e ma shi e kwabe mashapo de Bele yi, dandani e dege a bisi e ba su mbosi.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />De nana puari, ntani keyi guru nsu worosu de su man suwo yiri yiri, se e sa nani e yi a kiya kowon daa e worikye su. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Jaja mumungu aworo kwa butu bila ntani Nyowa, sua yi kuruwa su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki ma Yaa Mirikisi!&gt;&gt;Sede e kwabe su se e nana su beta, sobon su shina e ma kiristi la.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Beyi Manki a Kolonwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1.35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />De anya kwa yi Yesu te anya de nse daa ma ba. Ntani sua bila e yi sede su zo anya de e ma, sua so de kede e bila su gagaba. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Sede Yesu nkye,&lt;&lt;Dole na Ni te gye su nabari kyakyawu ni solota Mirikisi ba worosu geri du, sobon yomuna su saka Ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Se Yesu sigeba ni beyi manki a siki kolonwa ni kesa Yawudiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Sukwa Yayagizi yi Ni Pari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1.16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Na daa de Yesu sakisi a keteri riki ni Janisarat, ntani Nyowa gyowe yi sua kiri nkiasu de su zi kokoyi ni kelima ni Mirikisi, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Yesu geni kwanto bi a karishe riki, de nsu kaa gunda bila, sua wonkye eya asu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu yuru a siki kwanto daa, de mani Biturusu, se e gye yi nkye kiri kwanto piri ta siki riki. se e zunwa yaa kokoyi ntani a siki kwanto.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />De Yesu gama beta, e gye Biturusu, &lt;&lt;Ki Kiri kwanto te anya ondum riki, de ku sa eya de ku ka gunda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Biturusu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Nsugizi, mua pama ANKI tun dederi mu ka mbodaa ba. Sede tunde ki pala yomu, Na kutiri eya a siki riki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />De su yi mbo de Yesu gye su, se su kaa gunda nyowa de sa eya asu e para saga. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />De su geni yomu, se su sukwa oboki ANKI asu de su ma siki kwanto daa de su zo sua su nto, se su sika kwanto guru bi ni gunda de saa yaa so de yuru a siki riki sobon loni gunda.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />De Biturusu geni mbo de paru, e puari a geba Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Te ma ke bila ni, Obagizi; Ni ma nsu lepi la!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />E shi nja guru nsu de su ma gabada su yi mamanki ni gunda de su kaa butu nshi, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />yomu na Yakubu nja Yaaya, yaya ni Zabedi, de su ma oboki anki ni Biturusu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Se Yesu gye Biturusu nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ki zi womba; dege kuzukam ta geba ka kaa ntani na ba gunda ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Se su jaa kwanto asu ta keteri baki riki, su bila mbode sua yi guru su biya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Worikye Nseminji Nsu Kputuru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1.40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />De Yesu ma a siki geri daa, nseminji daa de nki e yi guru ma kputuru. De e geni Yesu, e dure a kisi a geba Yesu e bayi kadishiya nkye, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, nde ki yeda, kisa de ni worikye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu munka nani e yi kpa nseminji. &lt;&lt;Nkye E ni ni yeda,&gt;&gt; Ki worikye! dandani kputuru e yi worikye bila e yi.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Se Yesu ja yi kuni kede ki gye nseda ba, sede ki te nana nki ke ba pirisi de ki ba su sedeka de kputuru ake worikye, nta yiri de Musa beyi doka de e ma sheeda ba su.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Sede nabari Yesu ma a kiya sigeba anya guru, ntani zo yowa de su zi yi nja de su worikye suwo asu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Sede Yesu ma kuku jaa nki e yi ta anya de nse daa ma siki e yi ba de yi lepa.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Worikye Nseminji Nsu Nki Sha riki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Nana daa de Yesu ma kokoyi, parisiyawa nja male ni doka Musa, worede zo dege kowoni geri ni Galili nja Yawudiya nja Wurishelima, su zunwa anya ni. Se sori ni Mirikisi zo beyi de worikye nsu suwo. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Worosu su menza la nsu nki sha riki zo a siki kalanga sua so de su keyi yi te a siki gizi a geba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />De su samu turiki de sua keyi te ba sobon yowa ntani, su biya nshi a kiya lenda keyi ta kisi a kalanga yi su sa yi a sisika yowa ntani, a geba Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />De Yesu geni beigaskye asu, nkye, &lt;&lt;Oboki, Mirikisi yape lepi ake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Parisiyawa nja male ni doka Musa su ma gye nkiasu nkye, &lt;&lt;Waa ma nse mu de yaa yi beta ni saba mu? Waa yaa yape lepi mba Mirikisi e shi dandaa e yi aba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu shina mbode sua yi tunani a kiya e minya nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina sa de kwa tunani mu a siki dishiya aku? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />De su pala nkye, &lt;Su yape lepi ake,&gt; ko su nkye, &lt;Dege de ki yi tepiya wona pi&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Sede mma so de ku shina nkye Yaa nsebeki e man yiko de yaa yape lepi a durinya.&gt;&gt; gye nsu nki sha riki, &lt;&lt;Na gye ke, dege a bisi, la kalanga ake de ki te a gizi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Dandani e dege a bisi a geba asu, e la kalanga e yi de e kwakwana a kiya e yi e te a gizi yaa yobo Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Guru ntani sua yi mamanki nja yobo Mirikisi. Su zi womba su nkye, &lt;&lt;Mu geni mbo beyi mamanki yawu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Sukwa Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />A beyi nsu mu, Yesu butu a woze e geni Nsu keleba gendu nsu keleba gendu de seni yi ma Lawi zunwa kingbolo keleba gendu. Yesu gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Biya ni&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Se Lawi dege a bisi, bila guru mbode yaa yi e biya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Se Lawi shiriya totolo buki ba Yesu a gizi e yi, se nsu keleba gendu Nyowa nja worosu ntani su ma si mbosi nja su. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Sede parisiyawa nja male ni doka Musa de ma nja su su yi mungu beta su gye yayagizi e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina sa de kwa si nja sha nja nsu keleba gendu nja nsu lepi&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu keleba asu, &lt;&lt;Ba worede su man lapiya na sua bila nsu megeni ba, sede worede sua yi suwo. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Ni zo de ni sukwa nsu yi mbo gangasi aba, sede worede sua yi lepi de su juyi bila lepi asu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Minya Yesu Beta A kiya Azimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Su gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Yayagizi Yaaya sua yi azimi nja lepa, yomu na yayagizi parisiyawa osu ma du sua yi azimi, sede yayagizi ake sua sigeba ni si nja sha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu keleba gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;kwa yi yaa sa de bakwe a buki amere ni ango su yi azimi tunde ango ma nja su? ayi yaama yomu ba! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Sede kwanki yaa zo de sua la ango bila su; kwanki ni sua yi azimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu gye su abenshi nkye: &lt;&lt;Ba nsude yaa saga sabuwa keyi de pashi nja wuri keyi. Nde e yaa saga sabuwa keyi ni, anya de dumki a sabuwa keyi yaa yi kyakya nja wuri ni ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ba nsude yaala riki janki yi nya a siki gwala de e man riki musha ba. Nde e yi yomu sabuwa abure yaa wokye gwala ni, riki janki de ma gwala yaala yowa nya. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Yi, sabuwa riki janki sua nya a siki sabuwa gwala na. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ba nsude yaa bila sha sabuwa riki inebi a beyi de e sha anko ni inebi, yaa nkye, &lt;&lt;Anko pi kyawu.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Minya Beta A kiya Nana Asibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2.23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Nana asibi daa Yesu ma bisi a bikiya ni alikama. se yayagizi yi su yenkye kiya ni alikama su murushe a nani asu su ma suku, <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Se worosu su parisiyawa su minya Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina sa de kwa yi mbode doka Musa yaa so de su yi ba a nana asibi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu keleba su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku taba karanta mbode Dowuda yi de e shi nja oboki tepiya yi su yi de sua zi nyunwa bo? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />E yuru a gizi Mirikisi, e la buredi de su sa a keteri su nkye kede nseda e kpa mbode su kyebe ba, e suku mbode doka ki nkye kede su suku ba se pirisi. Se e kwa la worosu su ba oboki tepiya e yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Se Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaa nsebeki e shiya ma Obagizi ni nana asibi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nseminji Nsu Nana sharuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />A nana asibi daa Yesu te a siki kolonwa yaa kokoyi su, nseminji daa ma anya ni de nani e yi e sha riki. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Parisiyawa nja male ni doka Musa sua bila turiki de su ka Yesu nlepi, sua kone yi ko yaa te worikye nsu suwo a nana asibi. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Sede Yesu shina tunani mbode sua yi e gye nseminji de nani e yi sha riki nkye, &lt;&lt;Dege de ki te sakisi a geba asu.&gt;&gt; E dege te sakisi a geba asu.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Se Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Na minya ku, a mina na doka pala de sua yi a nana asibi: Su yi kyakyawu ko mungu? Su sila leyi ko su kisa la?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />E kone su gyewe guru, se e gye nseminji ni nkye, &lt;&lt;Munka nani ake.&gt;&gt; E munka, se nani e yi kuma munka. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Sede su zi anwashi soseyi su sa kutiri beta nja nki asu mbode sua yi Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Zabi Yaya Manki Gom Sha Bi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3.13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />A siki kwanki ni Yesu te a bisi dunsi de e yi lepa. E kwana dederi yaa yi lepa te nja Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />De anya kwa yi, e sukwa yayagizi yi e zabi gom sha bi, de su ma yaya manki:<verse eid="LUK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Sima de sua sukwa yi nkye Biturusu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">de ma yayiwa Anduru,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yaaya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Pilibu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Batalomi,<verse eid="LUK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiyu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Tomasi, Yakubu yaa ni Alipasu, Sima de sua sukwa yi nsu so kesa e yi,<verse eid="LUK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yawuda yaa ni Yakubu, nja</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">Yawuda Isikariyoti, de butu Yesu a beyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kokoyi Ntani E kwa Worikye Su</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat 4.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu sonka a kisi nja su e sakisi anya de ma pili. Yowa yayagizi e yi su ma anya ni nja yowa ntani guru de su butu yiri Yawudiya, nja Wurishelima, nja guduma ni Taya nja Sidon, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />su zo de su zi nja de su worikye suwo asu. Nsu worosu de sua sha wuya ni mumungu aworo su samu worikye. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />se ntani guru sua so de su kpa Yesu, sobon sori ma butu anki yi se e worikye su guru.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peri Siki nja Beki Siki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu kone yayagizi e yi, nkye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Anabirika ma nja worede su ma potoruwa a siki Aworo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">solota gizi Mirikisi maana su la.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Anabirika ma nja ku de kwa zi nyunwa kuzukam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa koshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Anabirika ma nja ku de kwa yi kuka kuzukam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa yi dala.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Anabirika ma nja ku de ntani sua ki ku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">su ja ku te a keteri su ma basi ku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">su ki seni aku su nkye kuma mungu, sobon Yaa nsebeki.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />&lt;&lt;Ku yi peri siki nja dala a nana ni, sobon nani wuta aku e ma totolo na a siki bisi. Sobon yiri de adaatolo asu su yi anebi de rigye ku zo naka.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Sede gbotu aku oku de ku mani mbo nani kuzum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">dun ku rigye keleba sori guyam ku.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Gbotu aku oku de ku rigye koshi kuzukam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa zunwa ni nyunwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">gbotu aku oku de kwa yi dala kuzukam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa yi beki siki nja kuka<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Gbotu aku de ntani sua yi beta kyakyawu a kiya aku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">yomu na adaa asu su yi anebi nsu yi yaruwa aka.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku So Nsu yi Geba Nja Aku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7.12a</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;Sede Na gye ku oku de kwa zini: Ku so obokigeba ku, nsude sua so de su geni ndani aku ba ku yi su mbo kyakyawu, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />worede sua basi ku ku sa su anabirika, ku yi lepa ba worede sua ba ku geni beki. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nde nseda ma ke akumatu daa, juyi ni bi beyi du. Nde nseda la keyi ake, kede ki nana e yi ba, <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Guru nsude minya ake ki beyi, ko nse daa la mbode ma na ke nsori, kede ki keleba gagaba. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Yi ba ntani yiri de ka so de su yi ba ke.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Nde kwa so worede sua so ku, mina kwa samu anya ni? Ko nsu yi lepi sua so worede ma so su na! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nde kwa yi kyakyawu ba worede sua yi ku kyakyawu, mina ma riba de kwa samu ko nsu lepi osu ma sua yi yomu du. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nde kwa lemese ba worede kwa sadishiya sua kuma nshi ba ku, mina ma riba de kwa samu? ko nsu yi lepi sua lemese anya nsu yi lepi de su biya su kyakya. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Sede ku so obokigeba aku, yi su kyakyawu, ku lemese su kede kusa dishiya de sua biya ku ba. Se nani wuta aku yaama totolo, nja de kama yaya ni nsude ma pi girima, sobon e shi e ma dishiya din ni nsu worede sua gbede ba nja mungu ntani. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Kuman nsu toseyi, yiride adaa ku e ma nsu toseyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kede Ku yi Nseda Shiriya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />&lt;&lt;Kede ku yi nseda shiriya, sobon kede su yi ku shiriya ba. Kede ku bebeta nse daa sobon kede su bebeta ku du. Ku yape ntani lepi asu sobon oku ma Mirikisi yaa yape ku lepi aku. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ku beyi sobon oku ma sua ba ku. agongo gwadaa kyakyawu, sika ari yaa nya, gongo de ki gwadaa ntani nshi e shi na Mirikisi yaa gwadaa ke nshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu kwa gye su abenshi nkye: &lt;&lt;Makapi yaa jaa makapi gwala ba? Guru asu sua puari a romu? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Yaa makaranta yaa pi male yi ba, sede du nsu de su kokoyi yaa ma kankye male yi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Mina sa de ka kone dola de ma a siki ndani yayiwa ake dun mina ka kone ongbomu de ma a siki ndani eke ba? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Mina sa de ka gye yayiwa ake nkye, &lt;Zo de butu ke dola de e ma andani e ke,&gt; De ki bila ongbomu ma a siki andani eke? E ke munabuki, pari butu ongbomu de ma ndani ake tuku, de ki geni sere tuku de ki butu dola de ma ndani yayiwa ake.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntasi Nja Yaya yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;Ntasi nsu kyawu yaa yapu yaya mumungu ba, mumungu ntasi yaa yapu yaya nsu kyawu ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Sobon yomu kwa shina ntasi a yiri yaya de yaa yi. Ntani sua nweyi yaya bori a nki na ankwanya ba, ko yaya kera a nki ankwanya ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Nse kyakyawu yaa yi mbode kyawu butu a siki mbode e tala a rigogo dishiya yi, nse mumungu yaa butu mumungu mbo de tala a siki dishiya yi. Mbode sika a siki dishiya e shiya na baki yaa pala e yi.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntani Bii Nsu Gina Gizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Mina sa kwa sukwa ni, &lt;Obagizi, Obagizi&gt; Se kwa yi mbode Na so ba? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Guru nsude zo anya na e zi mbode ni pala ari e yi ANKI nshi ba, Na gye ku woni yiri nse ni ma. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Yaa ma kankye nseminji de yi gina gizi e yi, e yanka kisi tukuna e kapa kutiri laki e yi a siki dunsi. De su yi riki Nyowa, e dukwa gizi ni sede gizi ni eya zizika ba, sobon su kapa yi a kiya dunsi. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Sede nsude zi beta na se e yi ANKI nshi ba, e ma kankye nsu de kapa gini yi a kiya nyashi de e kapa kutiri yi kyakyawu ba. De su yi riki totolo, a buga gizi ni se e puari guru puari yi ma mumungu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Beigaskye ni Totolo Shoja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />De Yesu gama gye ntani guru mbo mu, e yuru a Kapanawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Anya ni bunwa totolo shoja Roma, de nsu gizi yi yaa so yi soseyi, yaa yi suwo yaa bila de muntu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />De totolo shoja Roma zi nabari Yesu e saka worosu su toree Yawudawa anya yi, su gye yi de e zo worikye bunwa yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />De su zo anya Yesu, su ologba yi soseyi, &lt;&lt;nseminji mu e yi kyawu de ki sua yi to, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />E so ntani amu nja e shi nkiya yi gini mu kolonwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu te nja su. De e kusa ni gizi ni se totolo shoja mu saka nsu oboki e yi anya Yesu:&lt;&lt;Obagizi, kede ki dama kiya ke, ni deta de na sonka a lenda gizi na ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />E shiya sa ni geni ni deta de ka zo anya na ba. Sede ki pala beta kede, bunwa na yaa worikye. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Eni nkiya na ni ma a nani ni yiko nseda la, niman shoja a nani na. Ni gye nse mu nkye,&lt;Te,&gt; se e te; nseda,&lt;Zo,&gt; se e zo. Ni gye bunwa na,&lt;Yi mbo mu,&gt; se yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />De Yesu zi mbode e pala, e yi mamanki, e juyi kone ntani de sua biya yi e gye su nkye &lt;&lt;Na gye ku, a siki Izireyila ntaba geni beigaskye nsu sori yiri samu ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Worede su saka su juyi te a gizi totolo shoja su san bunwa e yi worikye.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu worikye Yaa ni Mase Makeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />E dede ba, Yesu ta geri daa sua sukwa yi Nayi, yayagizi e yi nja ntani nyowa su te nja shi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />De e kusa ni kopa geri ni, ntani worosu su su ma butu ni yaa daa de muntu e shi dandaa na amaa e yi yapu yi, amaa e yi ma mase makeyi na. Ntani nyowa dege siki geri asu ma nja shi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />De Obagizi geni mase ni, e zi toseyi e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;kede ki yi kuka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Se Yesu kpa kyekpa ni nsu muntu, worede keyi kyekpa sakisi. Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaa sambari, Mma gye ke, dege a bisi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Nsude muntu dege zuzunwa yaa yi beta, Yesu leyi ba amaa e yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Guru asu womba ka su, su yobo Mirikisi. &lt;&lt;Totolo anebi ma a siki ni amu, &gt;&gt; su nkye. &lt;&lt;Mirikisi zo de E sila ntani e yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nabari mbode Yesu yi mu e zaga ko anga a siki ni Yawudiya nja kesa de ma kusa nja su.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya Manki Butu nja Yaaya Nsu Tunkwasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat 11.2-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />De yayagizi Yaaya nsu tunkwasa gye yi guru mbo worosu mu. E sukwa yayagizi ntani bi, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Yaaya saka su ayan Obagizi de su minye yi, &lt;&lt;E ke na ki ma nsu de yaa zo, ko mu pekye nse daa mbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />De menza worosu mu zo ayan Yesu, su nkye,&lt;&lt;Yaaya nsu tunkwasa saka mu ayake da mu minye ke, &lt;Eke na ki ma nsu sila mu de yaa zo, ko mu pekye nse daa mbo mu?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />A kyakya kwanki ni na,Yesu worikye ntani nyowa dege siki suwo, shuwuta nja aworo mumungu, e ba makapi nyowa ndani de su geni anya. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Yesu gye yaya manki Yaaya nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku kuma mbayi ku gye Yaaya mbode ku geni ku kuma zi: Makapi su ma geni gurugu su ma yi tepiya, kputuru su worikye, kuruma ma zi, worede su muntu su dege leyi, su ma gye potoruwa nabari kyakyawu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Anabirika ni Mirikisi e ma nja nsude su yi shaka ni beigaskye de su manshi a kiya na ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />A beyi de yaya manki Yaaya te ma su, Yesu sa kutiri beta gye ntani a kiya Yaaya: &lt;&lt;Minana ku te geni a siki denka? Ku te geni sanwa de akusuka yaa wula yi la? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Gyeni, mina ku te kone a denka? Nseminji daa de saa keyi kyakyawu na? Yi, worede sua sa keyi kyakyawu mu su ma zunwa a gizi seleki na. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Sede minana ku te kone? Anebi na? Ee, mma gye ku, e pi anebi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />A kiya ni Yaaya na beta ni Mirikisi su rubuta nkye:&lt;&lt; &lt;Na saka yaa manki na a geba ke, nsude yaa gyala turiki kapi de ka zo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Mma gye ku, a siki worede yapu su nseda pi Yaaya girima ba; nzun yomu nsude ma dende piri a siki solota Mirikisi e pi Yaaya girima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Guru worede su zi beta mu, nsu keleba gendu osu na nsu zi doka Mirikisi ni gangasi, sobon Yaaya na yi su tunkwasa. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Sede Parisiyawa nja male kokoyi doka Musa su ki mbode Mirikisi shiriya su nshi, su yeda de Yaaya e yi su tunkwasa ba.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu sigeba ni beta nkye, &lt;&lt;Ni mina, sua gwada ntani zamani mu nshi? Su ma woni yiri ntani? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Su ma kankye yaya dende na de su zuzunwa abije su ma sukwa nki asu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt;&lt;Mu pula ku tapire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ku ki wasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">mu yi ku wonka ni muntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ku ki de ku yi kuka.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yaaya nsu tunkwasa e zo e si mbosi ba e sha riki yaya ntasi ba, ku nkye, &lt;E ma ni arizeni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Yaa Nsebeki e zo e ma si e ma sha, ku nkye, nsu mungu si ni nsu sha giya bugu, oboki ni nsu keleba gendu nja nsu &lt;&lt;Lepi.&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Sede simi Mirikisi a nana gaskye ba guru worede yeda nja shi&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu A gizi Sima Nseminji Parisiyawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Kuzukam nseminji parisiyawa daa sukwa Yesu ta a gizi yi de e te si mbosi, de Yesu zuzunwa de si mbosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />A siki geri ni mase daa nsu yi lepi. E zi nkye Yesu ma si mbosi a gizi ni parisiyawa, e keyi tuni meyi kemeshi, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />e zo e sakisi a keteri Yesu anya seni e yi yaa yi kuka, e ma juku seni Yesu ni angweyi. Se e shire yi seni Yesu gesa kiya yi, e kpa seni Yesu ni baki e yi, se shapa yi meyi kemeshi.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />De nseminji parisiyawa mu geni mbode mase mu yi, e pala aleyi e yi, &lt;&lt;Nde nseminji mu ma anebi la, yaa shina waa ma mase de yaa kpa yi mu, sobon e ma nsu lepi na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu keleba parisiyawa mu, &lt;&lt;Sima, Ni mani mbode na gye ke.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">&lt;&lt;gyeni, male,&gt;&gt;Sima E keleba.<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />&lt;&lt;Su yi nseda de yaa biya ntani bi bashi. Nseda yaa biya yi deri biyari, nseda yaa biya yi amsin. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ba nseda a siki asu de man gyolo de yaa biya bashi mu ba, se e yape su ni gyolo ni guru asu. Kuzukam waana yaa so yi soseyi a siki ntani bi mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Sima keleba yi, &lt;&lt;Anyana nsude su yape gyolo nyowa ni na yaa so yi soseyi.&gt;&gt; Yesu nkye,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">&lt;&lt;ki pala kyakya,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu juyi kone mase ni e gye Sima nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki geni mase mu? Ni zo a siki gizi ake. Ki ba ni riki de ni wonkye seni na yiri ni alada mu ba, sede mase mu bila juku seni na ni anwe yi se e kwa shire seni na ni gesa kiya e yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />De ni yuru a gizi ake ki keleba ni nina bi bi ba, sede mase mu, tun kwanki de ni yuru, e bila kpa seni na ni baki e yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ki shapa ni meyi a kiya ba, sede mase mu shapa ni mayi kemeshi a seni na. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Sobon yomu, na gye ku, lepi e yi nyowa su yape yi nshi, sobon e nana so nyowa. Nsude su yape yi piri e nana so piri aka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Se Yesu gye mase ni nkye, &lt;&lt;Su yape ke lepi ake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Ntani de su ma si mbosi nja shi su mayi beta nki asu, &lt;&lt;waana ma nse mu ari e ma yape lepi.?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu gye mase ni nkye, &lt;&lt;Beigaskye ke e sila ke; sonka ni selema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya Nsu Nyunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />A beyi da mu, Yesu nja yayagizi sua gyewe totore geri nja geri dende, e ma yi kokoyi ntani nabari kyakyawu a kiya solota Mirikisi. Yayagizi e yi gom sha bi man nja shi, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />se worosu mata worede su worikye su dege aworo mumungu nja ni shuwuta asu: A siki asu Meremu dege Magadaliya, nsude su butu mungu aworo bokwe a nki yi; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yuwana mata ni Kuza, tolense ni gizi Yiridu ma a siki asu, nja Suzana, nja worosu mata nyowa de su ma sua Yesu nto ni a nki ni mbo asu de su manshi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi ni Nsu Nyunkwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />De ntani nyowa su tala dege geri bombom su ma zo anya Yesu, Yesu gye su abenshi mu: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Su yi nsu bikiya daa de e ta bikiya eya nyunkwa yiri. De eya nyunkwa yiri, worosu asu puari a kiya turiki; su tataka su, nsunsuwa bisi zabi su sherenka. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Worosu yiri puari a kiya dunsi, de su butu, se su kyekeri sede riki ma anya ni ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Worosu yiri puari a siki ankwanya, su dege gabada se ankwanya sukwa saba de butu. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Worosu su saba puari a kesa kyakyawu. su butu su yi girima su yi yaya, deri deri pi saba de su nyunkwa su.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">De Yesu gye su beta mu, se e yi sukwa, &lt;&lt;Nsude man kuni zi bila de e zi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Delili ni Abenshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4.10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Yayagizi Yesu minya yi nkye mina ma abenshi mu, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Su yeda ku de ku shina mbode ma a boyi ni solota Mirikisi, yiri de gye ntani na gye su beta ni abenshi na sobon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ko su kone sua geni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">Ko su zi sua gane ba&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gye su Misali Abenshi Nsu Nyunkwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4.13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Maana abenshi mu aka: Saba ni e shina ma kelima ni Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Yiri worede e puari a kiya turiki ni osu na su ma worede zi kelima ni Mirikisi, se obiri zo la kelima ni butu a siki dishiya asu, sobon kede su beigaskye de su samu sila. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Saba worede puari a kiya ni dunsi osu na su ma worede keleba kelima beta ni Mirikisi ni perisiki kwanki de su zi, sede a ririnya samu yuru te akisi kyakyawu ba. Su yeda kwanki piri na, sede gwada zo su se su puari. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Yiri de puari a siki ankwanya osu na ntani de zi kelima beta Mirikisi, bayi kwana bi, mbo durinya nja bila mbo nani, nja zunwa bila mbo durinya mu, sa su su yi girima ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Sede yiri de puari a kiya ni kesa kyakyawu ni osu na su ma worede keleba beta ni Mirikisi, su keleba ni dishiya daa, su sakisi nsori ari su beyi yaya.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitila A kiya Mbo Sakisi E yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4.21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Ba nsude yaa sa wuta pitila e la obubu ripe yi ko e la yi sa a kisi gbodo. De yaa yi yomu, yaa la yi sa a kiya ni gwala lete pitila, sobon ni ntani de ma yuru su geni asikye. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ba mbode ma riripe, de sua pelesa yi ba, kuma yomu na ba mbode ma riripe de sua bure yi a woze ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Sobon yomu ku nyunkwa kuni nkyawu yiride kwa zi beta. Nsude mani mbo e shiya sua kwa ja yi nshi; nsude mani mbo ba, mbode e manshi ma sua la keleba bila e yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amaa Ni Yesu Nja Yayuwa e yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3.31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Kuzukam amaa ni Yesu nja yayuwa e yi su zo anya Yesu de su geni yi, sede su yi yaa te anya e yi ba sobon ni yowa ntani. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Nse daa gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Amaa ake nja yayuwa ake su sakisi a woze, su ma so de su geni ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Amaa na nja yayuwa na osu na worede su ma zi beta ni Mirikisi, su la beta ni ma yi ANKI nshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Sakisi ni Gaguwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4.35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Nana daa Yesu gye yayagizi e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Mu nyenteri riki te a keteri.&gt;&gt; Su yuru a siki kwanto se su nyenteri te a woze. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />De su ma a siki tepiya, Yesu yi kwana. Su shina ba a gidagida yi beki akusuka nsu sori dege a siki riki. Su yuru a siki totolo aseri, sobon riki wula ma yuru a siki kwanto.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Yayagizi e yi dege yi a kwana, su nkye, &lt;&lt;Tolense, Tolense, mwa muntu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu dege a bisi kwabe akusuka nja agaguwa riki de ma somiya; akusuka nja riki sakisi ship. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu minya yayagizi e yi nkye. &lt;&lt;Beigaskye aku manga?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Su zi womba soseyi su yi mamanki su ma minya nkya su, &lt;&lt;Waa ma nse mu? E kobe akusuka nja riki, su kwa zi yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Worikye nja Nsu Arizeni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu nja yayagizi e yi su yi tepiya a siki kwanto ari su keyi kesa ni garasinawa, de ma a keteri totolo riki Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />De Yesu ma sonka a siki kwanto, e gom nja nseda dege geri ni de man arizeni. E dede de nse ni sa riga ba ko e zunwa a gizi, konana yaa zunwa kumsha. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />De nsu so minya ni geni Yesu, e puari a kisi a geba e yi, e yi kuruwa nsori nkye, &lt;&lt;Yesu, mina ka bila nja ni, Yaa ni Mirikisi? Mma ologba ke, kede ki ba ni wuya ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Yesu rigye kula mumungu aworo butu bila nki nseminji ni. Sobon kowoni kwanki mumungu aworo ma leyi buga a kisi, ko de su domuna yi seni nja nani nzun yomu yaa kukunshe serika de su domuna e yi nshi mumungu aworo ma kule yi te kumsha.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu minya nseminji, &lt;&lt;Seni ake ma waa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Nseminji ni keleba, &lt;&lt;Seni na ma nyowa,&gt;&gt; sobon mumungu aworo nyowa na ma nki e yi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mungu aworo ologba Yesu kede e kiri su te a siki romu anya de sua ba mungu aworo poro ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Anya asu alede nyowa su ma si mbosi a kiya ogbo. Arizeni ologba Yesu de bila su de su yuru a siki alede woroni, Yesu yeda su. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />De arizeni butu bila nseminji ni, su yuru a siki alede, guru alede ni dege ngudu yuru a siki totolo riki se riki te nsu. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />De worede ma kone alede ni su geni mbode paru, su yi gudu te a siki totolo geri nja dende geri su beyi nabari mbode paru, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />ntani butu te a woze de su geni mbode paru. De su zo anya Yesu, su zo sani nseminji de arizeni butu a nki e yi, zuzunwa a keteri Yesu, e sa riga e kuma ma a siki ankeli e yi; su zi womba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Worede ma anya ni kwanki ni gye ntani yiride nsu arizeni worikye. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ntani worede ma gyowe kusa ni garasinawa su ologba Yesu de bila kesa asu, sobon su zi womba. Se Yesu yuru a siki kwanto te meyi.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Anya ni nseminji de arizeni butu a nki e yi ni zo yaa ologba Yesu de e te nja shi, sede Yesu gye yi de kuma beyi, nkye, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Kuma te a gizi de ki gye ntani totolo mbode Mirikisi yi ke nshi.&gt;&gt;Nseminji ni kuma mbayi te a siki geri gye su mbode Yesu yi nshi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaa Mase de Muntu Nja Mase de Meyi Suwo de Kpa Riga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5.21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Konwawa ma pekye Yesu de e zo, su yi yi nnaba, dun su ma pekye yi la. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Anya ni nseminji daa sua sukwa seni yi Yayirus, e shiya ma tolense kolonwa, e zo dure a geba Yesu, yaa ologba e yi de te a gizi e yi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />sobon yaa e yi ndandaa kede ni mase, yaa shekera gom sha bi, yaa so de muntu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">De Yesu ma kiya turiki, ntani ma biya yi su ma kpa nki e yi a kowoni keteri. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />A siki asu mase daa de yaa Genbeki dege suwo ni nya zini shekera gom sha bi, a kisa guru mbode manshi a nani nsu megeni, ba nsude eya worikye yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />E zo a beyi Yesu e kpa kuni riga yi, anya ni zini de ma nya sakisi.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu minya &lt;&lt;Waa kpa ni?&gt;&gt; .</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Kowon nse nkye e shina ba, Biturusu nkye, &lt;&lt;Tolense, ntani su yi yowa kowoni nse ma kpa ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Sede Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Nse daa kpa ni; Sobon Ni zi sori butu a nki na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Se mase ni, geni su shina yaa yi yaa boyi gagaba, e butu nki e yi ma kakada e puari a geba Yesu. A ndani ntani guru, e pala mbode saa e kpa Yesu nja yiri de e worikye. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu gye yi nkye,&lt;&lt;Yaa mase, beigaskye ake worikye ke. Sonka ni selema.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />De Yesu tuku ma kiya beta, nse daa zo dege gizi ni Yaa yuru, tolense ni kolonwa. &lt;&lt;Yaa ake muntu&gt;&gt; e pala. &lt;&lt;kede ki dama male gagaba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />De Yesu zi yomu, E gye Yarisu nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ki zi womba; beigaskye ake, yaa sa yaa ake yaa worikye jaja.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />De Yesu keyi gizi ni Yarisu, Yesu saa nse daa yuru nja shi ba se Biturusu, nja Yaaya nja Yakubu, nja adaa nja amaa ni yaa ni. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />A kiya yomu ntani de su ma a gizi ni su mayi kuka nja beki siki sobon yaa mase de muntu. Yesu nkye. &lt;&lt;Kede ku yi kuka,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;E muntu ba yaa yi kwana na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Su yi Yesu dala ni nene, sobon su shina yaa mase ni e muntu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Sede Yesu ka nani yaa mase ni nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaa mase, dege a bisi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Se aworo yi kuma, dandani e dege a bisi. Se e gye su de su beyi mbosi de si. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Adaa e yi nja amaa e yi su ma yi mamanki, sede Yesu gye su nkye kede su gye nse daa mbode paru.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Saka Yayagizi yi Gom Sha Bi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Nana daa Yesu sukwa gom sha bi ni gabada, e ba su sori de su butu arizeni nja su worikye suwo guru, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />se Yesu saka su te a woze de su pala manki solota Mirikisi nja su worikye nsu suwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Yesu gye su nkye: &lt;&lt;kede kula mbodaa sobon tepiya aku ko gwala, ko Angala, ko mbosi, ko gyolo, ko riga bi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Guru gizi de ku yuru a siki e yi, ku zunwa anya ni ari de kwa bila geri ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nde ntani ki keleba ku, ku kekebe kulaa ni seni aku nde kwa te butu bilaa geri ni, e shiya yaa ma sheeda a kiya asu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Se su butu te su ma gyowe geri, geri, su ma pala nabari kyakyawu nja worikye ntani de su ma yi suwo guru.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiridu E damu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6.14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />De Yiridu seleki Galili zi nabari ni guru mbode a paru. E rikishe soseyi, sobon worosu su ntani ma nkye su dege Yaaya nsu tunkwasa dege kumsha, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />worosu su ma nkye anebi Iliya na e kwa dege, worosu su ma nkye daa a siki anebi na sakye dege nleyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Sede Yiridu nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaaya de Ni butu yi kiya. Waa, daa mu de ni ma zi mbo mu a kiya e yi?&gt;&gt; Hiridu yi kokori de e geni Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ba Ntani Dupu Biyari Mbosi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />De yaya manki Yesu kuma mbayi, su gye Yesu guru mbode su yi. Yesu la su nja shi su te a geri de sua sukwa e yi Beseda, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />sede de ntani zi nkye Yesu ma anya ni su biya yi. E yi su naba nzo se e yi su beta a kiya solota Mirikisi, e kwa worikye worede su ma so su worikye su.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />De nyema yi se yayagizi e yi zo anya e yi su nkye, &lt;&lt;Bila ntani de su te a siki dende geri nja beyi geri de su bila mbosi nja anya de sua kwana, anya de mu ma mu mani ntani de la mbosi see ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Oku ku ba su mbosi de su si.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Su keleba, &lt;&lt;Mu man buredi biyari nja gunda bi na kin sede mua te sa yi ntani mu guru mbosi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Menza de ma ayan sua keyi ntani dupu biyari.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu gye yayagizi e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Gye su de su zuzunwa ntani amisin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Yayagizi Yesu su yi mbode Yesu gye su, su saa ntani zuzunwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu la buredi biyari nja gunda bi mu e kone bisi, e gbede Mirikisi se e lalaba ba su. E ba yayagizi e yi su laba ba ntani. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Guru asu su si koshi, yayagizi e yi su kwa yi daa de rigye sika obubu gom sha bi.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu Gye su Waa ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mk 8.27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Naa daa Yesu mayi lepa e shi dandaa e yi, yayagizi yi su zo anya yi, e minya su, &lt;&lt;Ntani su ma pala nkye ni ma waa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Yayagizi yi keleba, &lt;&lt;Worosu su nkye ki ma Yaaya nsu tunkwasa; worosu su nkye Iliya; worosu su kuma su nkye, daa a siki anebi na dege nleyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu minya su. &lt;&lt;Oku pa?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Ku nkye ni ma waa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Biturusu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki ma Kiristi Yaa Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Beta A kiya Genbeki nja Muntu yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mat 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mk 8.30—9.1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesu jaa su kuni kede su gye nse daa beta mu ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu pala nkye, &lt;&lt;Dole na e ni Yaa Nsebeki ni sha wuya yiri yiri a nani toree ntani, nja pirisi nja Male kokoyi doka Musa su ki ni, ari su kisa ni a nana ni wuku sua kwa dege ni nleyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Se Yesu gye ntani guru nkye: &lt;&lt;Guru nsude ma so de biya ni, se ki kiya e yi e la gidiri e yi kowon nana de biya ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Guru nsude yaa sila ni leyi yi yaa lesa e yi, sede nsude lesa leyi e yi sobon eni yaa samu yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Mina yi nsebeki kyawu nde e samu durinya mu guru, se e lesa leyi e yi? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Du nsude zi kumnya naa nja beta na, Yaa Nsebeki ma yaa zi kumnya e yi kwanki de e zo a siki girima e yi nja girima ni Adaa e yi nja ni meleku nsuseki. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Na gye ku gaskye, worosu a siki aku de sakisi anya mu sua taba muntu ba se su geni solota Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nki Yesu Shenja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mk 9.2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />A beyi kwana takusi de Yesu yi beta mu, Yesu la Biturusu, Yaaya nja Yakubu su te a kiya dunsi de su yi lepa. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />De Yesu ma kiya lepa, pisika e yi shenja, keyi de e sa a nki juyi peri sere ari yaa kisa ndani. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Dandani ntani bi, Musa nja Iliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Su pelesa a siki dereja, sua yi beta nja Yesu. Su ma yi beta a kiya ni muntu e yi, de yaa sika beta ni Mirikisi a Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Biturusu nja oboki tepiya e yi su ma yi kwana, de su dege a kwana, su geni girima Yesu nja ntani bi sakisi nja shi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />De ntani bi mu sua bila Yesu, Biturusu gye e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Nsugizi, e man kyawu de mu ma anya mu. Bila mu yi rugwa wuku daa ma na ke, daa mani Musa daa mani Iliya.&gt;&gt; E shina mbode yaa pala ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />De Biturusu ma a kiya beta, se gidagida zo ripe su, su yi womba de su ma a siki ni gidagida. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Murinya butu a siki gidagida, nkye, &lt;&lt;Daa mu ma Yaa naa, daa de Ni zabi yi; ku zi beta de yaa gye ku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />De murinya ni yi shuru, se su geni Yesu e shi ndandaa na. Yayagizi e yi su keyi beta ni a dishiya asu, su gye nse daa mbode su geni a kwanki ni ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Worikye Yaa Daa Nsu Mungu Aworo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mk 9.14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />De anya kwa yi, Yesu nja yayagizi e yi su sonka a kiya dunsi, ntani nyowa zo sa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Nseminji daa a siki ntani ni sukwa sori, nkye, &lt;&lt;Male, mma ologba ke ki zi toseyi ni yaa na mu, e shi ndandaa na ma yaa na. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mumungu aworo ma nyunwa ari yaa sayi yi kuruwa de man kiya ba; aworo ni ma dukwa e yi ari nki e yi ma kakada kumpa yaa butu a baki e yi. Yaa bila yi ba se e zi yi suwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ni ologba yayagizi ake de su butu yi, su yi yaba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Oku ntani sana mere beigaskye nja nsu mungu mbo,&gt;&gt; Ari woni kwanki na, Na ma nja ku? Zo ni yaa ke ni anya mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />De yaa ni ma zo se arizeni ni la yi te a bisi buga a kisi, nki e yi ma kakada. Se Yesu kwabe mumungu aworo ni, Yesu worikye yaa ni la yi ba adaa e yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Guru asu su yi mamanki ni totolo mbode Mirikisi yi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu Sakye yi Beta A kiya Muntu yi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mat 17.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Kowon nse yi mamanki ni guru mbode Yesu yi, de e gye Yayagizi yi nkye, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Kede ku musi mbode ma bila de ni gye ku: Sua la yaa nsebeki beyi a nani ntani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Yayagizi e yi su gane beta de Yesu ma gye su ba. Su boyi su nshi, de kede su shina ba, su yi womba de su minya yi a kiya beta yi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waa Ma Totolo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9.33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Musu dege a sisika ni yaya gizi e yi a kiya waa ma totolo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu, shina dishiya asu, e la yaa dende sayi sakisi a keteri e yi. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Se Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Guru nsu de keleba yaa dende mu a siki seni na e keleba ni na ka; nsude keleba ni e keleba nsude saka ni na. Sobon yomu nsu de ma yaa dende a siki aku e shiya ma totolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guru Nsude yaa ki ke Ba E ma Na ke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mk 9.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yaaya nkye, &lt;&lt;Tolense&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mu geni nse daa yaa butu arizeni a siki seni ake mu nana e yi, sobon e ma nja mu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede ku nana e yi ba,&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;Guru nsu de yaa yi geba nja ku ba e ma na ku na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samariya Ni Dende Geri daa Su ki Keleba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />De kwanki Yesu yi de sua leyi te a bisi, Yesu dege te a Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Yesu saka yaya manki ta geba e yi, osu kwa su te a dende geri ni Samariya de su gyala mbo yi pekye yi; <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />sede ntani geri ni keleba e yi ba, sobon de sa kiya yaa te a Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />De yayagizi e yi Yakubu nja Yaaya geni yomu, su minya e yi, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, ka so de mu sukwa wuta dege bisi de suwuta su?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Sede Yesu juyi ni kwabe su, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Su kuma biya turiki te a geri daa mbo.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Nkye Sua ma Nsu Biya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat 8.19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />De su ma yi tepiya a kiya turiki, nse daa gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Eni ma biya ke guru anya de ka te.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu keleba yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Kere bikiya man romu asu nja nsunsuwa bisi su mani anya kwana su, sede Yaa nsebeki mani anya kwana ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu kwa gye nseminji daa, &lt;&lt;Biya ni.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Sede nseminji ni keleba yi, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, bila ni de ni te bishina adaa na tuku de ni zo biya ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Bila worede su shina Mirikisi ba de su bishina nkiya su, eke ki te pala manki ni solota Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nseminji daa kwa gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Na biya ke, Obagizi, bila de ni te seleme ntani gizi na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu keleba nkye, Guru nsude kaa barinya yaa yi noma nde e juyi kone beyi e yi kyawu de yi anki a siki solota ni Mirikisi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Saka Ntani Sebeyii Ni bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />A bayi da mu Obagizi zabi worosu su ntani Sebeyii ni bi e saka su bi bi su la geba te a geri geri nja anya de yaa yi shiri de yaa te. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Anki ma nyowa, sede nsu ANKI ma Nyowa ba. sobon yomu, ku yi lepa de Obagizi nsu bikiya, de e saka nsu ANKI de su yi ANKI. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ku te! Na saka ku kankye timshiya a sisika kere bikiya. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kede ku keyi gyolo ko Angala ko takalami; kede ku geshe nse daa a turiki.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Guru gizi de ku yuru, ku para nkye, &lt;Selema gizi mu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nde nsu selema ma gizi ni, selema aku e ma nja shi; nde nsu selema ma ba, selema aku yaa kuma biya aku. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ku zuzunwa a gizi ni, ku si ku sha guru mbode su ba ku, sobon e yi kyawu de su ba nsude yi ANKI lobo ANKI e yi de e yi. Kede ku biya gizi gizi.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />&lt;&lt;Guru geri de ku yuru nsu keleba ku, ku si guru mbode su keikei zo ba ku. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Ku worikye worede sua yi suwo a geri ni nja ku gye su nkye, &lt;Solota ni Mirikisi e ma kusa nku.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Sede ku te yuru a geri de su keleba ku ba, ku biya turiki turiki de ku pala nkye, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />Ko kula geri a ku de mala mu a seni mu, zizika yi ba ku. Sede ku shina nta solota ni Mirikisi e ma kusa nku.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mma gye ku, a nana karishe sua pi zi toseyi Sodoma pi ntani geri ni.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Geri de Ki Yeda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mat 11.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku, Korasin! Gbotuma ake, Betseda! nde mbo mamanki de su yi a siki aku nda su yi a Taya nja Sidon de sua bila mungu mbo asu, sua sa keyi sasa de su zuzunwa a siki busi. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Sua pi zi toseyi ni Taya nja Sidon a nana shiriya pi ku. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />E ke, Kapanawu, ki ma geni nta sua ba ke girima ari ki te a bisi na? Yi, sua keyi ke ta kisi na ari siki kumsha anya de nsu muntu sua ma.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Nsu de zi ku e zi ni; nsu de ki ku e ki ni aka; nsude ki ni kwa e ki nsude saka ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma ni Yayagizi Sebeyii Ni bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ntani Sebeyii ni bi ni su kuma ni perisiki su nkye, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, nzun arizeni e ma zi mu nde mu sukwa seni ake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Ni geni obiri puari dege bisi kankye asikye wuta butu dege bisi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ku geni! Ni ba ku yiko de ku taka mesi nja kunama nja kwa si nasara a kiya guru sori ni obokigeba ku; mbodaa mumungu kpa ku ba. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nzun yomu kede ku yi perisiki sobon mumungu aworo ma zi ku, sede ku yi perisiki de su rubuta seni aku a bisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Yi Peri siki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13.16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />A kwanki ni Yesu, sika ni peri siki dege ayan Aworo Mirikisi, nkye, &lt;&lt;Ni gbede Nke, Adaa, Obagizi ni bisi nja kisi, sobon ki boyi mbo worosu mu anya nsu wayo nja nsu shina, ki pelesa su ba worede su ma mbodaa ba. Ee, Adaa, da mu ma mbo de jima ke aka.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Mbo guru Adaa na la ba ni. Nse daa shina waa ma Yaa ni ba se Adaa e yi e shi dandaa, nse daa shina Adaa ba se Yaa ni nja worede Yaa so de e pelesa ba su.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Se Yesu juyi kone yayagizi e yi e pala gye su a boyi nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku ma nsu anabirika na de ku geni mbode ndani aku yaa geni mu. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Mma pala gye ku anebi nja seleki Nyowa su so de su geni mbo de kwa geni mu su geni ba, nja su zi mbode kwa zi mu su zi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyakyawu Nsebeki Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Male daa nsu kokoyi doka Musa dege a bisi de e gwada Yesu. E minya yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Male,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mina na yi de na man leyi ni dindindin?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu keleba e yi nkye.&lt;&lt;Mina doka Musa pala gye ku?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ku ma karanta yi nkye kona?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Nseminji ni keleba: &lt;&lt;&lt;Ki so Obagizi Mirikisi ake nja guru la yi ake nja guru dishiya ake nja guru sori ake guru ankeli ake&gt;; nja, &lt;Ki so dengeri ake yiri de ka so kiya ake.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu keleba nkye. &lt;&lt;Ki keleba kyakya,&gt;&gt;Yi yomu ka man leyi ni gbogbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Sede male ni kokoyi doka Musa yaa so de a nana kiya e yi nkye e shina mbode yaa pala, se e minya Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Waa ma dengeri na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu keleba nkye: &lt;&lt;Su yi nseminji daa de butu dege Wurishelima yaa te a Yeriko, se e puari a nani ni bolowa a turiki. Sukwa yi ka yi e yi, su dukwa yi soseyi se su bila e yi a baki muntu na su te ma su. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Se Pirisi daa biya turiki ni, de e geni nse minzi mu, e biya a keteri te mayi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Yomu du, nseminji Lawi, de e zo anya ni e geni yi, e shi ma e biya keteri daa e te mayi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Sede nseminji ni Samariya daa, ma te atepiya, de e keyi anya de nse ni ma; de e geni yi, e zi toseyi e yi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />E te anya yi se e domuna yi anya de su zi yi suwo, e nya e yi mayi nja riki anebi. e la yi lete kiya ni janki e yi, keyi te a laki bakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />De geri shekeri nsasape e la gyolo de yaama ni anki kwana bi e ba nsude yaa kula ni shi, Nkye, &lt;Kula nseminji mu,&gt; Nde ni kuma mbayi, na biya ake guru mbode ki kisa a kiya yi a beyi da mu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />&lt;&lt;Yesu minya nsu male kokoyi doka Musa nkye, a siki ntani wuku mu waa ma dengeri ni nseminji de bolowa dukwa mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Male kokoyi doka Musa nkye, &lt;&lt;Nsu de zi toseyi yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Eke ma te de ki yi yomu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu A gizi Ni Mata nja Meremu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />De Yesu nja yayagizi yi su ma a siki tepiya a kiya turiki, su keyi geri daa anya de mase nsu seni Mata keleba yi a gizi yi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Mata man yayiwa mase de seni yi ma Meremu, de zuzunwa a keteri Obagizi yaa zi mbode Yesu pala. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Sede Mata la dishiya e yi saa anya ANKI mbosi. E zo anya Yesu e minya nkye, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, ki ma kone yayiwa na bila ni e ni dandani ema yi anki ni mbosi? Gye yi de e zo sua nto!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Obagizi keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Mata, Mata,&gt;&gt; leyi ake basi nja e dege a kiya mbo Nyowa, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />sede mbo daa kede sua bila, Meremu rigye zabi mbo nsu kyawu, ba nsu de yaa keleba yi nshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Kokoyi Yesu A kiya Lepa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Nana da Yesu yaa yi lepa anya da. De e gama, da a siki yayagizi e yi gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, kokoyi mu yiri de mwa yi lepa, yiri de Yaaya kokoyi yayagizi e yi. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde kwa yi lepa, ku nkye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt;&lt;Adaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">seni ake e ma seki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">solota ake e zo.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Ki ba mu mbo si ni yawu nja ni kowoni nana.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Yape mu lepi amu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">yomu na omu ma muma yape worede de yi mu lepi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Kede ki ka yi mu te a siki ni gwada ba.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Se Yesu gye yayagizi e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde nse a siki aku mani oboki, e te ayayi sisika ndederi e gye yi nkye, &lt;Oboki, lemese ni buredi wuku, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />sobon oboki na daa butu atepiya e zo anyana kuzukam, ni ma ni mbode na beyi ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Se oboki de su te anya yi te bila lemese ni buredi mu e keleba yiri a siki laki nkye, kede ki dama ni, ni rigye kule kopa laki na wo, e ni nja yaya na guru mu rigye kwakwana. na yi yaa dege de ni ba ke mbodaa ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Mua gye ku, ko nkye yaa dege de beyi mbo daa ba sobon e ma oboki e yi na, nzun yomu sobon dama de oboki yaa dama e yi yaa dege de e beyi ko buredi kwana e ologba e yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Mua pala gye ku: Ku minya sua ba ku; ku bila kwa samu; ku te kwala kopa, kopa yaa bure ba ku. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Guru nsude minya yaa keleba; nsude bila yaa samu; nja nsude kwala kopa, kopa yaa bure ba e yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Waa a siki aku, nde yaa e yi minya e yi gunda, yaa beyi mesi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ko e minya yi kwoyi, yaa ba yi kunama? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nsu oku, de ku ma mungu ntani, ku shina yiri de kwa ba yaya aku mbo kyakyawu, birishi Adaa ku ni bisi e man shiri de yaba worede su ologba e yi Aworo Nsuseki!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Nja Baazabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mk 3.20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesu yaa kula arizeni daa de mayi beta ba butu. De arizeni butu, nseminji de yaa yi shuru yi beta, ntani su yi mamanki. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Sede worosu su ntani su nkye, &lt;&lt;Baazabu, seleki arizeni, na ba Yesu sori de yaa butu arizeni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Worosu so de su gwada e yi su gye yi nkye e yi su alama daa a bisi de yaa nana sori e yi.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu shina tunani asu de su mayi e gye su nkye: &lt;&lt;Guru solota de laba bii su mayi geba nja nkiya su yaa taba sakisi ba, yomu na gizi de laba bi yaa puari. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Nde Obiri laba kiya yi bi e mayi geba nja nki e yi, solota e yi yaa sakisi? Na pala yomu na sobon ku nkye ni ma butu arizeni ni sori ni Baazabu na. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nde ni sori Baazabu na ni ma butu arizeni, ni sori waa yayagizi aku sua butu arizeni? Sobon yomu, osu na sua yi ku shiriya a kiya daa mu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Sede nde ni ma butu arizeni ni sori ni Mirikisi na, solota ni Mirikisi zo anya aku aka. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Nsu nsu sori, sika ni ka yi yanki soseyi ma kone gizi e yi, ka yi gizi e yi yaa ma a siki selema. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Sede nde nsu de ma sori pi yi shakiya yi ni dukwa, yaa keleba guru keyi yanki de nsu shi sadishiya yi shi yaa lalaba guru keyi kwa yi nbolowa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Nsude ma nja ni ba yaa yi geba nja ni naka, nsude tala nja ni ba, yaa zizila la.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma ni Mungu Aworo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Nde mumungu aworo butu nki nsebeki, yaa te anya de man denka ba eya bila anya de yaa pushe nde e samu ba. Se yaa nkye, &lt;Na kuma te a gizi na de ni bila.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nde e kuma te a gizi de e butu, na e san gizi ni su shire yi kyakyawu su gyala e yi. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Yaa kuma beyi te kwa yi worosu su mumungu aworo gunda bokwe de su pi yi mungu, sua te zuzunwa anya ni. Bebeta ni nseminji ni yaa pi ni pari e yi mungu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ta Anya Perisiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />De Yesu ma gye su yomu, manshi daa a siki ntani ni dege ni murinya nkye, &lt;&lt;Mirikisi e sa manshi de yapu ke anabirika nja de goyi ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Anabirika pi ma a kiya worede su zi beta Mirikisi su kwa biya betayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alama Ni Yunusa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />De ntani ma ja yowa, Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Daa mu ma mumungu zamani na. Su ma bila de su nana su alama, ba nseda de yaa nana su nshi sede alama ni Yunusa. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Yiride de Yunusa ma alama anya ntani Neneba, yomu na yaa nsebeki yaa ma alama ni ntani sana mu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />A nana Shiriya mata seleki kudu yaa dege nja ntani sana mu e gye su nkye su yi kyakya ba; sobon e zo dege kesa nsu nyisa e zo de zi kokoyi simi ni seleki Sulemanu, nsude pi Sulemanu ma anya mu. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />A nana shiriya, ntani Neneba sua dege nja ntani zamani mu su gye su nkye su yi dede ba; sobon su bila lepi asu a manki Yunusa, kuzukam nsude pi Yunusa aka anya mu.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pitila Ni Nki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">6.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:23">23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />&lt;&lt;Ba nsu de yaa sa wuta a pitila de yaa la yi boyi ko e ripe yi ni terebi, sede e la yi lete a kiya ni ntasi de sua lete pitila, sobon worede su ma yuru a gizi sua geni asikye. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ndani ake ma pitila ni nki ake la. Nsu ndani ake ma kyakyawu, nki ake guru yaa sika ni asikye. Sede nde ndani ake su yi mungu, yomu na nki ake ma yaa ma beki na kiri. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ki kone yi, ko asikye de ki man shi e ma dopuwa na ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nkayomu, nde nki ake guru sika ni asikye, ba anya daa de ma dopuwa, guru nki ake yaa ma asikye, yiride de asikye pitila ma yi asikye ANKI ake.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Pelesa Asiri Ni parisiyawa nja Male Ni Kokoyi Doka Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />De Yesu gama beta, nseminji Parisiyawa sukwa Yesu te a gizi e yi de su si mbosi; Yesu te zuzunwa a kingbolo de si mbosi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />De nseminji ni Parisiyawa mu, geni Yesu wonkye nani kapi de e si mbosi ba, e zi mamanki.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Se Obagizi gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Kuzukam, oku Parisiyawa kwa wonkye sere beyi ni koshiya nja koriya, sede siki aku sika ni opu nja mungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Oku Odundu ni ntani! Mirikisi de yi woze ni e shiya yi siki ni ma du bo? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Sede ku beyi mbode ma a siki koshiya nja pereti ba potoruwa, se guru mbo yaa ma sere ba ku. <verse eid="LUK 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku Parisiyawa, sobon kuma beyi daa a siki gom aku ni akpoko nja genya ni miya ni ririgye keyi bikiya aku guru, sede ku ki yi mbo gangasi nja so ni Mirikisi. E kamata de ku yi woromu na ba de ku bila ririgye ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Gbotuma aku Parisiyawa, sobon kuma so kyakyawu kingbolo a siki kolonwa aku nja gesuwa abije. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />&lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku, sobon kuma kankye kumsha de ntani shina yi ba, de ntani mayi tepiya a kiya yi sobon su shina ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Daa a siki ni male kokoyi doka Musa keleba Yesu, &lt;&lt;Male, de ki pala mbo worosu mu, ki bashi mu aka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku, male ni kokoyi doka Musa, sobon ku domuna ntani ka yi wato doka nsu loni la, oku nkiaku ku taba kpa ka yi ni nja yaa nani aku ba de ku sua su nto.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />&lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku, sobon ku gina kumsha nsu kyawu nyowa ni anebi Mirikisi, de nsu adaatolo aku kisa su. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Oku nkiyaku ku sheeda nja mbode nsu adaatolo aku su yi; su kisa anebi nyowa, oku kwa ku gina kumsha su. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Sobon yomu na, Mirikisi a siki simi yi nkye, &lt;Na saka su anebi nja yaya manki, worosu su sua kisa su worosu su asu sua Genbeki.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Sobon yomu sua ba ntani kuzukam Genbeki sobon kisa ni anebi nyowa de su yi tun yiri pari durinya, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />yiri zini ni Abila ta ni Zakariya, de su kisa sisika bagadi nja anya de man dola ba ni siki laki Mirikisi. Ee, Na gye ku, sua poro ntani kuzukam sobon loni mbom guru.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Gbotuma aku male kokoyi doka Musa, sobon ku keyi mukuli ni ilimi. Oku nkiya ku, ku yuru ba, ku bila worosu de su yuru ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />De Yesu bila anya ni, se Parisiyawa nja male kokoyi doka Musa su para sayi a geba su ma bila turiki de sua keyi ni lepi su ma minya beta a kiya mbo nyowa de su dege yi dishiya, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />sua pekye de su ka yi ni mbo daa de yaa pala.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Beta A kiya Ni Munabuki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10.26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />De ntani dupu Nyowa tala, ari su ma takada nki asu, Yesu para yi beta nja yayagizi yi, nkye: &lt;&lt;Ku kula yisti ni Parisiyawa, munabuki. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ba mbode su ripe de sua bure yi ba, ko mbode e ma a boyi de sua ki shina ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Mbode ku pala a siki dopuwa sua zi yi a pili nde geri shekeri, nja mbo de ku pala a kuni a siki laki de ku ripe sua pala yi a kiya lenda laki.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsude Sua zi Womba yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mat 10.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Oboki na, Na gye ku, kede ku zi womba ni nsu kisa nki a beyi de su kisa sua yi yaa yi mbodaa nshi ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Sede Eni ma gye ku nsu de kwa yi womba yi: ku yi womba Mirikisi, de a beyi de e kisa nki aku, e kwa mani yiko de yaa la nki aku kutiri a siki wuta. Na gye ku e shiya ma nsude ku yi womba yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Yaya ogbanjo biyari na su ma la see toro bi bo? Nzun yomu Mirikisi moshi nja daa asu ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Yomu, ko gesa kiya aku ma su kiriga su guru. Kede ku zi womba; nkaa ku pi yaya ogbanjo dereja.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki Yesu A geba Ntani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mat 10.32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10.19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;Na gye ku, du nsude gye ntani nkye su yeda nja ni, Yaa Nsebeki ma yaa nkye e yeda nja shi a geba meleku ni Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Sede nsude ki ni a geba ntani e ni ma na ki yi a geba ni meleku ni Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Guru nsude yi beta ni saba a kiya ni Yaa Nsebeki sua yape yi, sede nsude saba Aworo ni Mirikisi sua yape yi ba.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Nde su keyi ku zo a geba ni toree kolonwa, ko a geba nsu yiko ku, ko a geba nsu solota, kede ku da mu sobon yiri de kwa butu kiya aku ko mbode kwa pala, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />A kwanki ni Aworo ni Mirikisi yaa kokoyi ku mbode kwa pala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi ni Odundu Nsu Mbo nani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Nse daa a siki ntani gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Male, gye yayiwa na de e laba lobo ni gado de adaa mu muntu bila mu nsi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Oboki, waa sani ma nsu shiriya ko nsu laba ku keyi de adaa ku muntu bila ku nshi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Se Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku kone! kede kuma nsu opu ni mbo durinya; sobon nyowa ni mbo durinya e shina ma samu leyi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesu gye su abenshi mu: &lt;&lt;Bikiya ni nseminji daa nsu mbo a nani bayi yaya nkyawu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />E yi tunani a dishiya e yi, &lt;Minana na yi? Ni ma ni rigogo totolo de na nya ka yi bikiya na ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Se e pala nkye, &lt;Damu na ma mbode Na yi. Na juru rigogo na de ni yi daa totolo, anya ni Na tala guru mbo bikiya nja keyi de ni ma nshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Na gye la yi na nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki mani mbosi Nyowa de yaa la ke shekera Nyowa. Zuzunwa de ki pushe, ki si, ki sha, nja ki yi peri siki.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />&lt;&lt;Sede Mirikisi gye yi nkye, &lt;E ke Odundu! A siki dederi mu ka muntu. Ma geni ko waa yaa si keyi de ki tala mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />&lt;&lt;Yesu karikye nkye, Yomuna yaama nja dun nsude e tala mbo ba kiya e yi sede anya ni Mirikisi e mani mbo nani ba&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kede Ku Da mu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Se Yesu gye yayagizi e yi nkye: &lt;&lt;Nkaa yomu Na gye ku, kede ku da mu ni leyi aku, mbode kwa si; ko a kiya ni nki aku, mbode kwa saa. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Leyi aku pi mbosi, nja nki pi keyi de kwa saa. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Ku kone nsunsuwa: Su ma nunkwa ko tala mbosi ba, su mani laki ni tala mbosi ko rigogo ba; nzun yomu Mirikisi ma si nsu. Oku ku pi nsunsuwa dereja bo! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Waa a siki aku sobon damuwa de e ma shi yaa yi yaa ja kiya e yi keripi daa a siki leyi e yi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Tunde kwa yi yaa yi mbo dende mu ba, mina sa de kuma damu a kiya mbo de rigye?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Ku kone yiri de pure ma girima. Sua yi ANKI ba ko dunki ba. Nzun yomu Na gye ku ko Seleki Sulemanu ni guru girima e yi e taba sa keyi de kyawu pi daa a siki genya woromu ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nde yomu na Mirikisi ma sa sanwa ni denka riga, sanwa de su ma leyi yawu, gobe a suwuta su a siki kongo wuta, birishi oku de yaa sa ku riga, oku nsu beigaskye piri! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Kede ku sa dishiya aku a siki mbode kwa si ko kwa sha; kede ku da mu a kiya yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ko worede su ma ni durinya su ma bila yiri mbo woromu du, Adaa ku de ma a siki bisi shina nkaa kuma so su. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Sede ku para bila solota ni Mirikisi npari, se guru mbo worosu mu sua ba ku.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kokoyi A kiya Mbo Nani A bisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;Kede ku yi womba, gerike dende, Adaa aku ni siki bisi e mayi perisiki de e ba ku solota ni bisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Ku la mbode ku manshi guru la see de ku gyolo ba potoruwa. Ku tala kiya ku mbo nani anya yaa bebeta ba, ku tala kiya mbo nani ku a bisi anya de bebeta, sobon de ba bolowa de yaa te kwa yi ku nshi ba ko gana yaa bebeta ku nshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Anya de mbo nani ake ma, ayan na dishiya ake yaama.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunwa de zunwa Ashiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />&lt;&lt;Kuzukam nshiri sobon ANKI kuma ku bila pitila ku si geba ni asikye, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Ku ma Kankye bunwa de su ma pekye nsugizi asu de e zo dege anya buki amere, kwanki de e te zo kwala sua bure yi kopa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Yaama mbo perisiki la anya bunwa worede nsugizi asu zo sa nsu sua yi kwana ba su ma pekye nyi ari kwanki de e zo. Na gye ku gaskye, yaa butu riga de e sa, e gye su de su zuzunwa a kingbolo de su si mbosi nsugizi asu mu nkiya e yi yaa keyi su mbosi. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Bunwa mu su ma nsu anabirika na nde e zo sa nsu su ma pekye yi, ko e zo nsisika dederi ko ni sasape e zo sa nsu su ma pekye yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Sede ku shina da mu: Nde nsu gizi yaa shina kwanki de bolowa yaa te zo a gizi e yi, yaa Bele yi de e yuru e bebeta yi gizi ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Oku ma ku zunwa nshiri, sobon Yaa nsebeki yaa zo a kwanki de ku shina ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bunwa Nsu Aminshi ko Mere Aminshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat 24.45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Biturusu minya Yesu, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, ki ma gye mu na abenshi mu, ko kowon nse na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Obagizi keleba, &lt;&lt;waa ma bunwa mu nsu aminshi nja nsu simi mu, de nsugizi e yi yaa sayi de e kone gizi yi e kuma ba nsu bunwa yi mbosi asu a kyakya kwanki? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Yaman mbo perisiki anya bunwa mu de nsugizi e yi yaa zo san shi mayi ANKI a kwanki de e kuma beyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Na gye ku gaskye, yaa sa bunwa mu de e kone yi mbode e man shi guru. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Sede nde bunwa mu yi beta a siki dishiya e yi nkye, &lt;Nsugizi na zo seberi ba,&gt; se e si geba nja dukwa bunwa menza nja bunwa mata mu e kuma sigeba nja si nja sha ari e bugu. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Nsugizi ni bunwa mu yaa zo a nana nja kwanki de bunwa mu shina ba. Yaa yi bunwa mumungu dukwa yaa kuma la yi sa nja worede su nja mere beigaskye ni Mirikisi.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Bunwa de shina mbode nsugizi e yi ma so de e yi se e yi ba e kuma yi mbode nsugizi e yi ma so ba sua yi poro soseyi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Sede daa de shina mbode nsugizi e yi nkye e yi ba e kuma yi mbode sua dukwa e yi sua dukwa e yi piri. Dege anya nsude su beyi nyowa, sua bila nyowa dege anya e yi; nsude kuma su beyi mbo nsu yowa soseyi sua, keleba mbo nsu yowa soseyi anya yi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Zo Ni Laba Kiya Na Ba Selema Ba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Wuta Ni zo nshi de ni sa a durinya, so na la de su wula wuta ni wo! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Sede Ni mani tunkwasa de sua yi ni nshi, na sayi a siki dishiya na ari se e sika! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Kuma yi tunani Nka ni zo ni selema na a durinya? Ayi, Na gye ku gaskye, laba kiya na ni zo nshi. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Dege kuzukam ntani biyari sua ma a gizi daa sua laba bi, wuku sua yi geba nja bi bi sua yi geba nja wuku. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Adaa yaa yi geba nja yaa yi yaa yi geba nja adaa e yi, amaa yaa yi geba nja yaa ni mase yaa mase yaa yi geba nja amaa e yi, amaa ni minzi yaa yi geba nja mata yaa mata ni yaa kuma yaa yi geba nja amaa ni minzi e yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shina Kwanki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2">Mat 16.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu gye ntani nyowa: &lt;&lt;Nde ku geni bisi juyi beki butu anyema, dandani kwa nkye, &lt;riki yaa zo,&gt; Yomu na sua yi riki. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Nde ku zi akusuka wula butu a kudu, kuma nkye sua yi dimi, Yomu na sua yi. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Munabuki! Ku yi yaa pala yiride kisi nja bisi sua juyi. Sede mina sa de ku yi yaa pala alama ni kuzukam ba?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiriya Nja Nsude yi Kara ke</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25">Mat 5.25</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Mina sa oku Nkiyaku kwa yi shiriya ni mbo de man kyakya de kwa yi ba? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nde oboki geba ake keyi kara ake te a laki shiriya, yi kokori de ku shiriya nja shi tunde kuma a kiya turiki, nde ki ki yaa keyi ke te anya jakada, jakada yaa keyi ke te anya yaya gwala, yaya gwala yaa la ke sa a siki jaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Na gye ke, ka taba butu ba se ki beyi karishe ni toro de ki manshi kpataka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Juyi Ko Ki Bebeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Kuzukam, worosu su ntani de su ma anya ni su gye Yesu nabari ni ntani Galiliya de Bilatu sa su kisa su a kwanki de sua beyi Mirikisi sedeka asu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Kuma yi tunani nta ntani Galiliya mu, su pi konwawa lepi a siki Galili sobon su sha Genbeki? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Yi! Na gye ku, Sede ku juyi bila lepi aku ba oku ma guru kwa bebeta. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ko ntani gom sha takusi de laki Silomo puari a kiya su kwa yi tunani su yi lepi pi ririgye ntani de sua zunwa a Wurishelima na? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Yi! Na gye ku, nde ku juyi bila lepi aku ba, oku ma guru kwa bebeta,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kokongye A kiya Ntasi Bure de Mani Yaya Ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Se Yesu gye su abenshi nkye, &lt;&lt;Nseminji daa mani ntasi bori, de e nyunkwa a bikiya e yi, de e te de e nweyi yaya yi, sede e samu yaya a siki e yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Se e gye nseminji de yaa kone bekiya nkye, &lt;E yi shekera wuku mu ari kuzukam Na zo bila yaya ntasi bori mu ni samu mbodaa a siki yi ba. Sala e yi kutiri a kisi! mina sa yaa tele kesa yomu?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Se nsu gyala bikiya keleba nkye, &lt;Tolense, bila e yi meyi shekera nsum; na yanka romu gyowe yi de ni nya yi taki. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Nde e yi yaya gagaba, to, nde e te yi yaya ba, mu sala yi kutiri a kisi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu worikye Mase Nsu Suwo A nana Asibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Nana ni asibi Yesu yaa kokoyi ntani a kolonwa ni Yawudawa. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Se mase daa de mumungu aworo sayi suwo ni shekera gom sha takusi. Se tonkori eya mu ka ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />De Yesu geni yi, se e sukwa yi nkye, Iwa gizi, ki worikye a siki suwo ake.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Se Yesu sa yi nani, dandani mase ni munka dege a bisi e yobo Mirikisi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Sede tolense ni kolonwa yi anwashi de Yesu worikye manshi mu a nana ni asibi, se tolense ni kolonwa ntani de su ma anya ni nkye, Mu mani nana shida de mwa yi yanki. Se ku zo a siki nana mu de e worikye ku, ba nana ni asibi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Se Obagizi keleba yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Oku munabuki! waana a siki aku yaa kunshe janki dege laki de te nshi a woze de beyi riki nana ni asibi ba? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Se mase nsum, de ma yaa mase ni juriya Abireyi, de obiri domuna e yi shekera gom sha takusi mu; ba dede na de su worikye yi a nana asibi bo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />De Yesu pala mbo mu, guru nsu oboki geba e yi su zi kumnya, ririgye ntani su yi peri siki sobon mbo mamanki de e yi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi yiri ni Mustard Nja Yisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mat 13.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4.30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Se Yesu minya su, &lt;&lt;Nja mina Na gwadaa solota gizi Mirikisi nja shi?. <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Solota Mirikisi ma kankye yiri saba Mosta de nseda la yaapi a bikiya yi. E yi girima e kuma ma ntasi, se nsunsuwa bisi sua yi gizi a yaya nani ntasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kokongye A kiya Yisti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu sakye minya su, &lt;&lt;Nja mina Na gwada solota Mirikisi nja shi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Solota Mirikisi e ma kankye darigaza de manshi daa la nya a siki atuwa nyowa e kakada yi ari e ripe yi guru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Turiki Kopa Diriri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mat 7.13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Se Yesu te atotolo geri nja dende geri, yaa kokoyi ntani a turiki de yaa te a Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Nseda minya yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Obagizi, ntani piri na sua samu sila?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu gye su nkye, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Yi guru kokori ake de ki yuru a kopa diriri, sobon ntani nyowa, Na gye ku, sua yi kokori de su yuru sede sua yi yaa yuru ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Nde nsugizi dege ripe kopa, kwa sakisi a woze kwala kopa ologba yi, &lt;Tolense, bure mu kopa.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Sede keleba su nkye, &lt;Ni shina ku ba ko ku butu angana.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Se kwa pala nkye, &lt;Mu si mu sha nja ke, ki kokoyi ntani a geri amu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Sede Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;Ni shina ku ba, ku butu angana, ku dege anya na, guru aku nsu yi mumungu mbo!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Kwa yi kuka nja suku akuri kwanki de ku geni Abireyi, Ishaku nja Yakubu nja guru Anebi a siki solota Mirikisi, sede oku sua la aku kutiri a woze. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ntani sua butu yiri anse nja nyema, kudu nja arewa, sua la anya zunwa asu anya buki solota Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Gaskye worede su ma ni karishe sua mani pari, ni pari sua mani karishe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Yi Beki Siki Sobon Wurishelima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />A kwanki ni worosu su parisiyawa su zo anya Yesu su gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;dege bila anya mu de ki te anya daa mbom. Yiridu yaa so de kisa ke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Te de ki gye kere bikiya ni, &lt;Na kula arizeni nja worikye ntani yawu nja gobe, nja nana ni wuku mma yi mbode ni sa dishiya Na yi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />A kowon turiki, ema Ni dole na de nsi geba nja tepiya te yawu nja gobe, nja nana ni wuku, de E tabata nkye ba anebi de yaa te muntu a geri daa ba se a Wurishelima! <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />&lt;&lt;Aya Wurishelima, Wurishelima, eke de ki kisa Anebi nja ki ribi worede su saka su ni manki anya ku, sen kona Ni mayi kokori de ni tala yaya ke, kankye kaza de yaa tala yaya dende siki nguki yi, sede ki yeda ba! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Kone, gizi aku yaama kupayi. Na gye ku, kwa geni Ni gagaba sede nana de ku nkye, &lt;Anabirika ma nja nsude yaa zo a siki seni Obagizi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu A gizi ni Parisiyawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />A nana asibi, Se Yesu te de si mbosi a gizi ni tolense parisiyawa, ntani kapa yi ndani sua kone yi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />A geba e yi nseminji daa de seni e yi nja nani e yi kyubu zo anya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu minya parisiyawa nja male worede su shina doka, &lt;&lt;A siki doka e kyawu de su worikye ntani a nana asibi ko e yi kyawu ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Se su zunwa shuru. Yesu worikye nseminji nsu suwo e gye yi nkye te ma ke. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Se Yesu minya ntani nkye, nde nse daa a siki aku e mani yaa ko saa de puari a romu a nana ni asibi, de dandani yaa butu yi aromu ba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Se su yi yaa keleba yi a kiya mu ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">La Ki yaa ke Ma Kankye Mbodaa ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu geni a siki worede de su sukwa de su zo anya si mbosi su zabi anya zunwa nsu girima, Yesu gye su abenshi nsum: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />Nde nse daa sukwa ke buki ni amere, kede ki zunwa akigbolo nsu girima ko e sukwa nsude pi ke girima. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Nde e ma yomu, nsude sukwa guru aku yaa zo gye ke nkye, ki bila tolense nsum kingbolo.&gt; Ka zi kumnya, sobon ka kuma te zunwa a kingbolo de e ma dereja gagaba. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Sede nde su sukwa ke buki, te de ki zunwa a kingbolo de e mani dereja ba, e zo gye ke nkye, &lt;Oboki, zo a bisi a anya kyakyawu.&gt; Anya ni sua ba ke girima a geba ntani buki de ki ma nja su. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kowon nsude e ba kiya yi girima, sua la yi e ma mbodaa ba, sede nsu de bwala kiya ma mbodaa ba, sua la yi ma nsu girima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Se Yesu gye nsu de sukwa buki, &lt;&lt;Nde ki sukwa nse daa ni si mbosi nsape ko nyema, kede ki sukwa oboki ake, ko yayuwa ake ko dengi ake, ko nsu mbo nana ko dengeri ake kin ba; nde ki yi yomu, sua sukwa ke nana daa de ki biya mbo de su yi ke nshi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Sede nde ka sukwa buki, ki sukwa potoruwa, nja gurugu nja nsu nki sha riki nja makapi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Yomu na ka mani anabirika, dun sua yi yaa biya ke ba, sua biya ke nana de ntani gangasi sua dege a kumsha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kokongye ni Totolo Buki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Se daa a siki worede su ma nja shi asi mbosi, gye Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Nsu anabirika na nsebeki de si mbosi anya buki solota ni Mirikisi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu pala nkye: &lt;&lt; Nse daa shiriya totolo buki e sukwa ntani Nyowa. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />A kwanki ni buki e yi e saka bunwa e yi manki nja worede e sukwa su, &lt;su zo, guru mbo ma a kisi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Sede guru asu sua beyi nja wuja. Nse ni pari nkye, Ni see pili, E ma dole de Ni te geni yi, kadishiya ki bilani de nte,&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />&lt;&lt;Nseda nkye, ni se saa ni noma gom, Ni ma a turiki de nte gwada su. Kadishiya ma ke nja ni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />&lt;&lt;Nse daa kuma nkye, &lt;Ni yi amere, sobon yomu na zo ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />&lt;&lt;Se bunwa zo gye nsugizi e yi guru mbo de su gye yi. Se nsugizi e yi yi anwashi e kuma gye bunwa e yi, nkye te kurukuzum de ki biya turiki nja lelenga ni geri, de ki tala nsu de su ma potoruwa, nja gurugu, nja makapi, nja nsu nki sha riki.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Bunwa nkye, &lt;&lt;&lt;Tolense, &lt;Mbo de ki sani ni yi, sede anya tuku ma.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />&lt;&lt;Se nsugizi gye bunwa yi, &lt;Te a woze golonwa de ki biya turiki nja siki geri de ki sa ntani de su zo, sobon de gizi na e sika. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Na gye ku, ba nse daa de a siki ntani de Ni sukwa su buki de su ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Genbeki Ni Biya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat 10.37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Yesu nkye mma gye ku, nana da ntani Nyowa sua biya yi, se e juyi gye su nkye, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Guru nsu de yaa zo a anya na yaa ki adaa e yi nja amaa e yi, nja mata yi nja yaya e yi, yayuwa e yi menza nja mata, ee ari nja leyi e yi ba, yaama yayagizi na ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Guru nsu de la gidiri e yi de biya ni ba yaama yayagizi na ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Gaskye, nde nseda a siki aku yaa bila de e gina laki. Yaa para zuzunwa de kone mbode yaa kaa, e geni ko gyolo de e manshi yaa deta yi ari de yaa gama gini yi bo? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Nde e kapa gini de eya karikye ba, guru nsu de geni gini e yi yaa yi dala. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Sua nkye, nse mu kapa gini sede e yi yaa karikye ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />&lt;&lt;Ko nde Seleki daa yaa bila de e te ayanki ngazi nja Seleki daa. sede yaa para zunwa de geni ko yaa te yi yaa yanki ngazi nja shoja dubu gom de e yi yanki nja Seleki de e mani shoja dubu ashirin? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nde yaa yi ba, seleki yaa saka yaa manki yi tunde su ma nyisa de te anya asu de bila zunwa selema.<verse eid="LUK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yomu na, kowon nse a siki aku yaa bila guru mbo de e man shi ba yaama yayagizi na ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Giri de Mani Anki Ba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9.50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Giri e man kyawu, sede nde giri bila zanki yi, yaa man zanki gagaba? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />E mani ampani daa a kesa ko taki gagaba; sua leyi nya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt;Nsude man kuni zi, bila de e zi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Kokongye ni Timshiya de Beta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Kuzukam nsu keleba gendu nja &lt;&lt;Nsu lepi&gt;&gt; Guru su tala de su zi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Sede parisiyawa nja male ni kokoyi doka Musa sua yi mungu beta a dishiya asu, &lt;&lt;Nseminji mu e keleba nsu lepi ari yaa si mbosi nja su&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Se Yesu yi su abenshi nkye: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Nde nse da a siki aku mani timshiya deri se da beta a siki asu, yaa bila teseyin ntera de e te bila da de beta ari e samu yi bo? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nde e geni yi, yaa yi peri siki yaa leyi sa gawuya yi <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />yaa ta a gizi. Se yaa te sukwa nsu oboki yi nja dengeri yi yaa gye su nkye, ku sua nto yi peri siki; Sobon ni geni timshiya naa de beta.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mma gye ku yomu na sobon mwa yi perisiki nyowa a siki bisi a kiya ni nsu lepi da de juyi nja ntani teseyin ni tera de sua bila juyi biya gangasi ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya Gyolo De Beta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Ko ankye Mase daa mani toro gom se da beta. Yaa sa wuta pitila e yi, de shire gizi e yi sunu ari e geni gyolo e yi bo? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nde e geni gyolo e yi, yaa sukwa nsu oboki e yi nja dengeri e yi agye su nkye, &lt;&lt;ku sua nto yi peri siki; ni geni gyolo na de e beta.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Yomu na, Na gye ku, Meleku ni Mirikisi sua yi perisiki a kiya ni nsu lepi da de juyi bila lepi e yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya ni Yaa minzi de beta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu sigeba pala nkye: &lt;&lt;Nseminji da mani yaya bi <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yaa dende gye Adaa e yi nkye, &lt;Adaa, ba ni mbo de e ma gado na.&gt; Se Adaa asu laba mbo de e manshi e ba konse na yi.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />A beyi nana piri Yaa dende tala guru mbo de e ma nshi, e dege ta kesa da nsu nyisa e kisa guru mbo de e man shi e zunwa wopi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Beyi de e gama kisa guru mbo de e manshi, se nyunwa yuru a kesa, se e ma bila mbo si. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Se e bila yanki anya yaa kesa ni daa, e sa yi yaa ma nsu kone alede de ba su mbosi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Yaa bila de sika siki e yi ni mbosi de alede sua si, sede nse da beyi mbo si ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;De e kuma zo a siki ankeli yi, e pala nkye, yaya ANKI kona su ma nja Adaa na sua yi banza ni mbosi, se eni ni zunwa muntu ni nyunwa anya mu! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Na dege de ni kuma te anya ni Adaa na de ni gye yi nkye: Adaa ni yi Mirikisi lepi ni kuma yi ke lepi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ni deta de ka sukwa ni nkye yaa ke ba; Ki sani de ni ma da a siki bunwa worede sua yi ke ANKI.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Se e dege kuma ta anya ni Adaa e yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Tun de e ma nyisa Adaa e yi geni yi, se e zi toseyi e yi; E yi gudu ta anya yaa e yi, e runguma e yi.<verse eid="LUK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />&lt;&lt;Yaa e yi gye yi nkye, &lt;Adaa, Ni yi Mirikisi lepi ni kuma yi ke lepi. Ni deta de ki sukwa ni nkye yaa ake ba,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Sede Adaa gye bunwa e yi, &lt;Ku yi Seberi! de yi shompa angwe kyakyawu de ku sa yi nshi. Ku sayi arika yaa nani yi de ku sayi takalami a seni e yi. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ku zo saa de e yi kiba de ku yanka de mu yi buki nja peri siki. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Sobon yaa na de muntu e kuma man leyi; e beta mu sa muyi.&gt; Sobon yomu mwa yi buki.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />&lt;&lt;A kwanki mu Yaa yi totolo ma a bikiya. De e zo a baki gizi, se e zi sua buga ganga nja wasa. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Se e sukwa bunwa yi daa e minya yi mina yi tepiya. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />&lt;Dende ake na e zo,&gt; Bunwa gye yi, &lt;Adaa ake sa mu yanka saa nsu kiba sobon dende ake kuma beyi zo nja lapiya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />&lt;&lt;Se Totolo e yi yi anwashi e ki bise ta siki. Se Adaa e yi ta anya e yi a woze ologba yi beyi kadishiya. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Sede e keleba Adaa e yi, &lt;Kone! Guru shekera mu ANKI nja ke kankye bunwa Ni taba ki doka ake ko ni nene beta ke. Ki taba ba ni ko yaa ni akuya de ni yi buki nja nsu oboki na ba. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Sede yaa ake nsum de te kisa guru mbo de ki manshi anya ni mata nsu ki laki kuma zo a gizi, ki yanka yi saa nsu ki ba!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Adaa e yi nkye, &lt;&lt;&lt;Yaa na,&gt; &lt;Ki ma nja ni kowoni nana, kuma guru mbo de ni man shi e ma na ke la. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Sede e yi kyawu de mu yi peri siki, sobon yaa ya ake e muntu e kuma zo leyi; e beta mu kuma samu yi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya ni Wakili de E man Gaskye ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu gye yayagizi e yi: &lt;&lt;Nse daa nsu mbo nani de yaa basi wakili ni nsu ANKI e yi nkye yaa yi banza nja keyi e yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Se e sukwa yi a siki te minya yi, &lt;Mina na zi a kiya ke mu? Ba ni lisapi ni mbo de ma guru a kiya ANKI ke, sobon yomu ka ma tolense ni ANKI mu gagaba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />&lt;&lt;wakili gye kiya yi nkye, &lt;Mina na yi kuzukam? Nsugizi naa yaa bila kula ni anya ANKI. Ni ma sori de ma yi noma ba, na zi kumnya de na te ologba mbo. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Wakili pala nkye, ni shina mbode ma yi, nde ni lesa ANKI na, ntani sua keleba ni a gizi asu,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Se e sukwa konse de nsugizi yi yaa biya yi bashi. E minya ni pari, &lt;kona nsugizi naa yaa biya ke?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Gwala ni mayi guda deri takusi,&gt; E keleba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">&lt;&lt;Bunwa gye yi nkye, &lt;Keleba takada ake, zuzunwa kuzukam, de ki rubuta deri wuru.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Se e kuma minya ni bi, &lt;E ke ma kona yaa biya ke?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;&lt;Buwu ni alikama dubu daa, &lt;e keleba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Bunwa gye yi nkye, &lt;Keleba takada ake de ki rubuta deri takusi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Nsugizi mu yobo mere gaskye wakili de yi banza ni keyi yi sobon de wayo yi. Nkaa yomu ntani sana mu su shina yiri de sua biya ntani asu ni wayo pi worede su ma ni asikye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Se Yesu sigeba ngye su nkye, ku la mbo nani de ku man shi de ku samu oboki ba kiya ku, nde mbo nani ku yaa, sua yi ku naba a gizi sonka ni dindindin.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Du nsude ema mere gaskye a kiya mbo piri yomu na yaa yi aminshi nja mbo Nyowa, du nsude yi aminshi a kiya mbo de e manshi piri ba yomu na yaa yi aminshi nja mbo de e manshi Nyowa ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nde ku ma mere beigaskye a kiya mbo nani ni durinya mu, waana ba ku mbo nani ni gaskye? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Nde ku te yi aminshi a kiya keyi ni nse daa ba, waana ba ku mbode e ma na ku?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Ba bunwa de a bowuta nsugizi bi a kwanki daa. Sede e ki zini daa de so daa, ko e mala nja daa de bila daa. Kwa bowuta Mirikisi nja gyolo a kwanki daa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Worosu Kokoyi Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mat 11.12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />De parisiyawa zi guru mbo de e pala, su yi Yesu sheki, sobon su ma nsu so gyolo na. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Oku na kwa yobo kiya ku a geba ntani, sede Mirikisi shina dishiya aku. Mbo de ntani leyi man dereja anya su ema anya Mirikisi ema mbo rebi la.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Doka ni Musa nja mbo de anebi kokoyi ntani ari kwanki ni Yaaya. Tun dege kwanki ni, nabari kyakyawu ni solota gizi Mirikisi sua gye ntani, konse yaa masa nki yi de yuru a siki yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Yaa pi soki de bisi nja kisi su bise nja mbo daa de su rubuta dende a siki doka Musa de yaa beta.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Du nsude shika mata yi de yi amere nja mase daa yi zina naka, du nseminji de yi amere nja mase de minji yi shika yi e shi ma du e yi zina naka.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nsu Mbo Nani nja Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Su yi nseda mani mbo nani yaa sa riga kyakyawu soseyi de ma ruwa za nja gawura yaa si mbosi kyakyawu na ko nana. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />A kopa gizi e yi nse daa ma nsu ologba mbo seni e yi ma Lazaru, suwo ripe nki yi <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Yaa bila de si mbosi de yaa puari dege kingbolo si mbosi ni nsu mbo nani. Ari kere sua zo rishe suwo e yi,<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Kwanki zo nsu ologba mbo muntu meleku la yi abenshi anya ni Abireyi. Nsu mbo nani ma zo muntu su bishina yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />A gizi wuta, e kone bisi se e geni Abireyi nyisa, nja Lazaru a geba yi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Se e sukwa yi, &lt;Adaa Abireyi&gt; zi toseyi naa de ki saka Lazaru de e sa yaa nani yi riki de e riga ni nshi arishiya de yi seni, sobon ni ma zi wuya a siki wuta mu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Se Abireyi keleba, &lt;Yaa, ki turunwa ni kwanki ake de ki ma nleyi, ki keleba mbo kyakyawu a durinya, Sede Lazaru e sha wuya, sede kuzukam yaa samu takuwa, sede kuzukam ki ma ka sha Genbeki. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />A beyi mbom guru, a sisika amu nja oku totolo romu ma, sobon kede nse daa e butu anya amu e zo anya aku, ko nse daa e meteri dege anya aku e zo anya amu ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />&lt;&lt;Se nsu mbo nani keleba, &lt;E ni na ologba ke, Adaa, saka Lazaru de e te a gizi ni Adaa naa, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ni man yayuwa biyari menza. E te de e kwabe su, kede osu ma su zo anya ni Genbeki wuta nsu zapi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Abireyi keleba nkye, &lt;Su man Musa nja anebi; su zi mbo de sua gye su.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />&lt;Adaa Abireyi, &lt;&lt;Yi,&gt; nkye, sede nse daa yiri a kumsha te anya su, sua juyi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />&lt;&lt;Sede Abireyi gye yi nkye, &lt;Nde sua zi Musa nja Anebi ba, sua taba yeda ba ko nseda dege a kumsha na.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Lepi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mat 18.6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mk 9.42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu gye yayagizi e yi nkye: &lt;&lt;Mbo de yaa sa nsebeki titimi e ma dole na e zo, sede gbotuma a kiya ni nsu de e shi na e sa yaa zo. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Yaa pi kyawu de su domuna e yi dunsi leda a wuya e yi de su la e yi kutiri te a siki andun riki nja de e sa yaya dende mu su yi lepi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Sobon yomu ku kula nkiya ku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">&lt;&lt;Nde yayuwa ke yi ke lepi, ki kwabe yi, nde ologba ke, ki yape yi. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nde e yi ke lepi sen bokwe a nana daa, se e kuma zo sen bokwe e zo ologba ke nkye, &lt;Ni juyi,&gt; ki yape yi&gt;&gt;,<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Beigaskye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Se yaya manki gye Obagizi nkye, &lt;&lt;Ki ja mu beigaskye amu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Obagizi keleba, &lt;&lt;Nde ku man beigaskye dende kankye saba ni Mosta, &lt;Kwa gye totolo ntasi mu, butu de ki sakisi a siki totolo riki,&gt; yaa yi mbo de ku pala. ,<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anki ni Bunwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />E yi kyawu daa a siki aku e mani bunwa de yaa yi noma ko yaa kone timshiya. Yaa te gye bunwa kwanki de e zo dege bikiya, &lt;Zo kuzukam de ki zunwa ki si mbosi&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ko yaa gye yi nkye zo, ki shiriya ni mbosi nyema keyi ni de ni si nja sha; a beyi da mu e ke ma ka si ka sha&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />E shi yaa gbede ni bunwa sobon e yi mbode e gye yi nkye e yi? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Se oku ma du, nde ku yi guru mbo de su gye ku nkye ku yi, ku nkye, &lt;Mu ma bunwa na mu deta ba; mu yi anki amu na kede.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Worikye Kputuru Gom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu ma a turiki ni Wurishelima, e biya yanka de ma sisika Samariya nja Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />De Yesu ma a siki tepiya ta dende geri, menza gom de su man suwo kputuru su sa nshi. Su sakisi nyisa <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Se su yi sukwa dege murinya nsori,&lt;&lt;Yesu, Tolense, ki zi toseyi amu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />De Yesu geni su, nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku te, de ku nana kiya a ku anya ni pirisi,&gt;&gt; Su ma a kiya tepiya, se su worikye.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Daa a siki kputuru gom, de e geni e worikye, e kuma beyi, e dege wurinya nsori yaa yobo Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />E dure a geba ni Yesu, e gbede yi e ma nse minji Samariya la.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu minya, &lt;&lt;Kuma gom na su worikye ku bo? Ririgye tera su ma angana? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Ba nse daa de e kuma zo de yobo Mirikisi ba sede bakwe mu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Se Yesu gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Dege de ki te; beigaskye ake e sa ki samu worikye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zo Ni Solota Gizi Mirikisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mat 24.23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Parisiyawa worosu, su minya woshe na solota gizi Mirikisi yaa zo, Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt; Solota Mirikisi yaa zo ta turuki de sua nya ndani kone ba, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ba nsude yaa pala nkye, &lt;E shi naka anya mu,&gt; ko &lt;E shina kaa anya ni,&gt; Sobon solota gizi Mirikisi e ma a siki aku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Se Yesu gye yayagizi e yi, &lt;&lt;Kwanki yaa zo de kwa bila de ku geni nana daa a siki nana ni yaa nsebeki, sede kwa geni ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ntani sua gye ku nkye, &lt;E shina kaa anya ni!&gt; ko &lt;E shina kaa anya mu!&gt; Kede ku yi gudu te anya su ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Sobon Yaa Nsebeki yaa zo a siki nana yi yaama kankye asikye, de yaa yi waliwali a bisi yaa beyi asikye a kowon ni anya a durinya guru. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Sede yaa ma dole na de e Genbeki mbo nyowa se ntani ni kwanki mu sua ki yi.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Nta yiri de e paru a kwanki Nuwu, yomu na yaa te paru a kwanki de Yaa Nsebeki yaa kuma zo. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Ntani sua si, sua sha, sua yi amere sua kuma beyi yaya mata amere ari e zo a nana de Nuwu yuru a totolo kwanto. Se riki nsu sori zo si ntani guru. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />&lt;&lt;E kwa ma yomuna a kwanki ni Lotu. Ntani su ma si su ma sha, su ma see su ma la see, sua nyunkwa sua yi gina. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Sede nana de Lotu bila Sodoma, wuta nja dunsi wuta butu a bisi zo suwuta ntani de su ma a geri ni kpataka.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />&lt;&lt;Yomu na yaama a nana de Yaa Nsebeki yaa kuma zo. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />A nana ni du nsude e ma a kiya lenda ni gizi, kede e sonka zo la mbodaa ba. Yomu na nsude e ma a bikiya kede e kuma ni beyi a kiya mbo daa. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Ku turunwa mbode paru Mata ni Lotu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Du nsude yaa bila tele leyi yi yaa lesa yi, du nsude lesa leyi yi yaa samu yi. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Na gye ku, ndederi de mbo mu yaa paru ntani bi sua kwakwana a gbodo daa sede sua la daa sua bila daa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mata bi sua yi leda adunsi daa; sede sua la daa sua bila daa. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Ntani bi sua ma a bikiya sede sua la daa sua bila daa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Yayagizi Yesu minya.&lt;&lt;Angana, Obagizi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu keleba su, &lt;&lt;Anya de nki gan ma anya ni onguru sua tala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya Lepa Kowon Kwanki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Se Yesu gye yayagizi e yi abenshi de shina su nkye su yi lepa kowon kwanki kede su geji. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yesu gye su nkye: &lt;&lt;A siki geri daa su mani nsu shiriya de yaa zi womba ni Mirikisi ba kuma yaa kula ni ntani ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />A siki geri ni mase makeyi daa ma yaa te anya Anikali de beyi mbode ema na yi, de e beyi mbo de e ma na yi a siki kara de su yi a kiya e yi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />&lt;&lt;E la worosu su kwanki e ki. Sede a beyi e gye kiya e yi, &lt;Ko e ma nkye na zi womba ni Mirikisi ko kula ni nse beki ba, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />nzun yomu Na yi kokori de ni beyi mbode ema na yi, de kede manshi makeyi mu e nana ni suguni!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Se Obagizi nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku zi mbode nsu shiriya nsu mere gaskye pala. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Yomuna Mirikisi yaa ba ntani yi de e zabi, worede de sua sukwa yi nnana nja dederi mbode sua so bo? ko yaa ki su? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Na gye ku, yaa ba su mbode ema na su seseberi. Nzun yomu, kwanki de yaa nsebeki yaa kuma zo, yaa sani nsu beigaskye a durinya mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi A kiya Nseminji parisiyawa Nja Nsu Keleba Gendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Worosu su de sua geni kiya su su ma ntani gangasi se sua kone worosu su su ma mbo daa ba, osu na Yesu gye su abenshi mu: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Ntani bi su ta gizi Mirikisi de su yi lepa, daa e ma nse minzi parisiyawa nja daa e ma e su keleba gendu na. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Se nseminji parisiyawa e dege a bisi yaa yi lepa nkye: &lt;Mirikisi, ni gbede nkye sobon mma kankye ntani nsu yi bolowa ba, nsu yi mungu mbo, nsu kwana nja mata nseda ko kankye nsu keleba gendu mere gaskye. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Na yi azimi sen bi a asibi na beyi daa a siki gom ni kowon mbode ni man shi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />&lt;&lt;Sede nsu keleba gendu e sakisi a bisi ni nyisa. E dege ndani e yi kone bisi ba, sede e ma dukwa dishiya e yi nkye, &lt;Mirikisi,&gt; ki zi toseyi naa, ni ma nsu lepi na.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Na gye ku nseminji nsu keleba gendu mu yaa te a gizi ba lepi a geba ni Mirikisi, e ma kankye nseminji Parisiyawa na ba. Guru nsu de la kiya yi ma mbodaa sua sa yaama mbodaa ba, sede nsu de la kiya yi e ma mbodaa ba sua sa yi yaama mbodaa,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya Dende nja Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10.13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />worosu ntani zo ni yaya dende anya Yesu de e sa su anabirika. De yayagizi yi geni yomu se su kwabe su. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Sede Yesu sukwa yaya dende zo anya e yi e gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku bila yaya dende de su zo anya na, kede ku nana su ba, sobon Solota gizi Mirikisi e ma ni yiri asu na. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Na gye ku gaskye, kowon nse de e keleba Solota gizi Mirikisi kankye yaa dende mu ba yaa taba yuru a siki e yi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tolense Nsu Mbo Nani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10.17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Tolense daa minya Yesu, &lt;&lt;Kyakyawu Male, mina na yi de na samu leyi ni dindindin?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina sa de ka sukwa ni kyakyawu?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ba nseda de ma kyakyawu sede Mirikisi e shi ndandaa yi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ki shina mbode doka pala: kede ki yi zina, kede ki kisa nse, kede ki yi bolowa, kede ki beyi sheeda ni yaruwa, ki ba Adaa ke nja amaa ke girima.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />&lt;&lt;Tolense pala nkye Yesu, guru mbo mu ni yi su tun de ni ma yaa dende.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />De Yesu zi yomu, e gye yi, &lt;&lt;Ki tuku lesa mbo daa. La guru mbo de ki manshi see de ki ba potoruwa, ka mani bogolo a bisi. Tuku de ki zo biya ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />De tolense zi beta mu, e yi beki siki, sobon e ma nse de e man ni mbo nani na soseyi. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu kone yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yaa mani wuya de nsu gyolo yaa yuru a siki solota gizi Mirikisi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Na gye ku, yaa pi soki de nakurimi e biya ndani aromuna nja nsu mbo nani e yuru a solota gizi Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Worede su zi mbo mu su minya, &lt;&lt;Waa te samu sila?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt;Mbode e yi wuya anya nsebeki yaa yi wuya anya Mirikisi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Biturusu gye yi nkye ki shina, &lt;&lt;Mu bila guru mbode mwa yi mu biya ke!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Na gye ku gaskye, &lt;&lt;Ba nse daa de yaa bila gizi e yi ko mata e yi ko yayuwa ko Iyaye ko yaya sobon yanki solota gizi Mirikisi <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />Yaa taba lesa keleba nyowa a siki sana mu nja samu leyi ni dindindin ba a sana nsu zo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Sakye Pala Yiri Muntu De E zo Yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10.32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu te ni sha bi a keteri daa e gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Mua ta Wurishelima, guru mbode Anebi su rubuta a kiya yaa nsebeki yaa ta sika. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Sua leyi beyi a nani worede su shina Mirikisi ba. sua yi dala nene, sua basi yi, sua nya yi anyanya. Sua yi amberemu nja de sua kisa yi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />A nana ni wuku yaa dege.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Yaya gizi e yi su shina mbode Yesu pala mu ba. Su mboyi maana e yi, su shina mbode yaa yi beta a kiya e yi ba.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makapi Nsu Pata Mbo Yaa Geni Anya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10.46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />De Yesu kusa ni Yeriko, Makapi daa zuzunwa a baki turiki yaa ologba mbo. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />De e zi ntani Nyowa sua bise, e minya su mina yaa paru. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Su gye makapi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yesu ni Nazere na yaa bise.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Se makapi yi sukwa nsori, &lt;&lt;Yesu, Yaa ni Dowuda ki zi toseyi na!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ntani worede su ma a geba su kwabe yi nkye yi shuru, sede e dege murinya nsori e yi guru, &lt;&lt;Yaa ni Dowuda ki zi toseyi na!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu sakisi e gye su nkye su keyi yi zo anya e yi. De e zo kusa, Yesu minya yi, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Mina ka so de ni yi ke shi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">&lt;&lt;Obagizi, E keleba na so de ni geni,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu gye yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Keleba geni ake; beigaskye ake e ba ke worikye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Dandani e geni anya e biya Yesu, e yobo Mirikisi. De guru ntani su geni, Osu ma su yobo Mirikisi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zaka nsu keleba Gendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu yuru a Yeriko e bise a siki geri. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Nseminji daa ma a geri ni de seni yi ma Zaka; e shi na ma tolense nsu keleba gendu, e ma nsu mbo nani soseyi <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Yaa bila de geni ko waa ma Yesu, sede e ma nse guntu yaa geni Yesu ba, sobon yowa ntani. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Se Zaka yi gudu ta geba su te nyunwa bisi ntasi totolo de e geni Yesu, tunde Yesu yaa biya turiki ni.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />De Yesu keyi anya ni, e kone bisi na e gye yi, &lt;&lt;Zaka sonka kuzukam. Eni ma su ka a gizi ka yawumu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Anya ni Zaka sonka seseberi na keleba yi ni peri siki. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />De ntani guru geni yomu se su yi mungu beta, &lt;&lt;Geni yaa ma bakwe a gizi nsu lepi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Sede Zaka dege a bisi gye Obagizi, kone anya mu, Obagizi! kuzukam Eni na beyi rebi ni mbode ni man shi ba potoruwa, nde Ni shushe nse da ni mbodaa, Naa biya sen wuru mbode ni keleba&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu gye yi nkye, yawu mu sila zo a gizi mu, sobon nseminji mu ma yaa ni Abireyi la.<verse eid="LUK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Sobon Yaa nsebeki zo de bilaa nja sila worede de su beta la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abenshi ni Pangom</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />De su tuku ma zi mbo mu, Yesu sigeba gye su abenshi, sobon e yi kusa ni Wurishelima se ntani sua yi tunani nta solota Mirikisi yaa zo dandani na. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt;Tolense nseminji daa te a kesa daa de su lende yi solota seleki de kuma zo. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Se nseminji sukwa bunwa yi ni gom e ba su gyolo, e gye su nkye ku yi bije nshi, se ni zo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />&lt;&lt;Sede ntani yi Sua bila e yi ba su saka manki te keyi nseminji mu nkye, mua bila nseminji mu de ma seleki amu ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Nzun yomu &lt;&lt;Su lende yi seleki, e kuma zo a gizi. Se e saka manki sukwa bunwa yi worede e ba su gyolo, yaa so de e shina ko su samu riba ni gyolo de e ba su. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ni pari zo nkye, &lt;Tolense, gyolo ake naka nja riba gom jaja. <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mgba anki, kyakyawu bunwa! Obagizi yi keleba. &lt;Sobon ki ma aminshi a mbo dende, ma ba ke dama de ki ma kamkiya ni totolo geri gom.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />&lt;&lt;Bunwa ni bi zo nkye tolense, gyolo biyari de ki ba ni, ni sakye samu riba biyari jaja.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />&lt;&lt;Obagizi yi keleba, &lt;Ka ma kamkiya totolo geri biyari.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />&lt;&lt;Se bunwa ni wuku zo nkye &lt;Tolense, gyolo ke naka; Ni boyi sa a siki kukukyo woriki. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ni zi womba ake, sobon ki ma nseminji nsu wuya shina la, nkye ki ma la anya de eke na ki la saba nja ka kwa yi anya de eke na ki nyunkwa ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />&lt;&lt; Obagizi yi keleba, &lt;Na yi ke shiriya a beta Baki ke, e ke mungu bunwa! Ki shina ko ki shina ba, nkaa ni ma nsebeki nsu wuya na, mma la mbode e ni na Ni la sa a kisi ba, nja kwa yi mbode e ni na ni nyunkwa ba? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ki shina yomu mina sa de ki la gyolo na sa laki boyi gyolo, de nte zo keleba ni riba ba?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />&lt;&lt;Se nsugizi ni bunwa ni gye worede su sakisi anya ni ku keleba gyolo ni dege anya e yi de ku la ba nsude man gyolo gom ni,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Tolense,&gt; su nkye, e rigye ma ni gyolo gom wo!<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />&lt;&lt;E keleba, &lt;Na gye ku guru nsude e manshi nyowa sua ja yi nshi, sede nsude manshi ba, ko piri de e manshi sua la keleba nshi shika yi nani <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Sede obokigeba na de su ma bila ni de ni ma seleki asu ba, ka yi su zo anya mu de ku kisa su a geba na.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yuru a Wurishelima</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />A beyi de Yesu pala yomu, E yi geba, ta Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />De e kusa keikei Betapaji nja Betani de sua sukwa yi Dunsi Zetu, saka yayagizi e yi bi, gye su nkye, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />&lt;&lt;Ku ta dende geri de ma a geba aku, ku te yuru kwa geni janki domuna anya ni, de nseda taba nunwa yi ba. ku kunshe yi de ku zo nshi anya mu. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nde nseda minya ku, &lt;Mina sa kwa kunshe yi?&gt; Ku gye yi, &lt;Obagizi yaa bila e yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Worede su saka su, su te san shi yiri de Yesu gye su. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />De sua kunshe janki ni, nde nsu nshi minya su, &lt;&lt;Mina sa kwa kunshe janki mu? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Su keleba, &lt;&lt;Obagizi yaa bila yi ANKI nshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Su zo nshi keyi Yesu, su nya keyi asu a kiya janki se Yesu nyunwa a kiya e yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu ma a kiya tepiya, ntani tona keyi asu a turiki.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />De Yesu zo kusa ni turiki de te ni Dunsi Zetu, na guru yayagizi e yi su para yi perisiki su ma yi yobo te nja Mirikisi ni totolo murinya sobon ni mbo mamanki de su geni ni ndani asu:<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />&lt;&lt;Anabirika nama seleki nsude yaa zo a siki seni ni Obagizi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;selema ma a siki bisi nja girima nja mirikisi a bisi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Worosu parisiyawa a siki ntani gye Yesu,&lt;&lt; Male, kwabe yayagizi ake de su ripe baki su! &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />&lt;&lt;Na gye ku, &gt;&gt; nde su yi shuru, dunsi sua yi kuruwa. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Kuka Sobon Wurishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />De Yesu zo kusa nja Wurishelima e geni totolo geri, e yi kuka sobon shi <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde oku, ari ni oku, da ku shina mbode yaa zo ku ni selema sede kuzukam e ma a boyi a ndani ku. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Nana ni yaa zo a kiya ku de obokigeba aku yaa gini golonwa de yaa tele ku a sisika kowoni keteri. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Sua taka ku a kisi, oku nja yaya ku a siki golonwa. Sua bilaa dunsi daa a bisi daa ba, sobon ku ki de ku gane kwanki de Mirikisi yaa zo de sila ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Te a Laki Lepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Se Yesu yuru a laki Mirikisi e para kula ntani de sua la mbo see. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />&lt;&lt;E ma rubuta a siki takada Mirikisi,&gt;&gt; Yesu gye su nkye, &lt;&lt; &lt; Gizi naa yaa ma gizi lepa&gt; Sede ku leyi ma kunguni bolowa,&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />kowoni nana yaa kokoyi a laki Lepa, sede Kamkiya Pirisi, nsu male kokoyi doka Musa nja toree ntani su ma bila turiki de sua kisa yi. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Sede su samu turiki de sua kisa yi ba, sobon guru ntani sua zi beta yi.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Su Minya Sori De Yesu E ma Anki Nshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11.27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Naa daa de Yesu ma kokoyi ntani a siki Laki Mirikisi nja beyi manki nabari kyakyawu, se nsu kamkiya pirisi nja male kokoyi doka Musa, gabada nja toree, su zo anya e yi. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Su nkye.&lt;&lt;Gye mu woni sori na ka yi mbo worosu mu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Waa ba ke sori mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt;E ni ma naa minya ku. Ku gyeni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Tunkwasa ni Yaaya e ma dege bisi, ko dege anya ntani?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Su yi shewura nja nki asu nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde mu nkye, &lt;Dege bisi yaa minya mu, &lt; mina sa de ku yeda nshi ba?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Sede nde mu nkye, &lt;Dege ntani,&gt; guru ntani sua kutiri mu dunsi, sobon su yeda nkye Yaaya ma anebi la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Se su keleba, &lt;&lt;Mu shina angana e butu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu nkye, Eni ma Na taba gye ku ko woni sori na mma yi mbo woromu ba.<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abenshi Nsu keleba Bikiya Ni Aya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu sigeba gye ntani abenshi mu: &lt;&lt; Yaa minzi daa mani bikiya, e la beyi aya nja worede su ma yi bikiya se e te a tepiya e la kwanki Nyowa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />De kwanki tala keyi bikiya se e saka bunwa e yi de e te anya worede keleba bikiya aya de su beyi lobo keyi bikiya yi. Sede nsu keleba aya bikiya dukwa e yi se su kule yi te su beyi nnani kwakwani. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />E kwa saka bunwa e yi daa, sede nsu keleba aya sukwa dukwa e yi su beyi kumnya se su kule yi te su ba yi ba mbodaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />E sakye saka nse daa ni wuku se su zi yi suwo su leyi kutiri a woze.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Se nsu bikiya ni nkye, &lt;Mina Naa yi? Na saka yaa na, de ni ma so; ni shina sua beyi girima.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />&lt;&lt;Sede de nsude keleba aya geni yaa ni ma zo, su gye nki asu nkye. &lt;Da mu e shina ma nsu si gado,&gt; &lt;Mu kisa e yi, de gado e ma namu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Se su la yi kutiri te a bayi woze ni bikiya ni se su kisa e yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">&lt;&lt;Mina nsu bikiya mu yaa yi worede keleba bikiya aya ni? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Yaa zo kisa worede keleba bikiya yi aya ni e la bikiya yi ba worosu mu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">De ntani zi mbo mu, su nkye, &lt;&lt;Kede yiri mbo mu e taba paru mu kankye ntani mumungu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu kone su tiriri e minya, &lt;&lt;Mina ma maana mbode su rubuta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Dunsi de nsu gini ki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">e shina yaa zo ma dunsi de sua la yi sa a keteri ni gini kyakyawu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Guru nsude puari a kiya dunsi ni yaa watala piripiri, sede nsude dunsi mu puari a kiya e yi yaa leda yi kankye busi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minya Bita A kiya Biya Gendu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Se male ni doka Musa nja nsu kamkiya ni pirisi bila turiki de su keyi dandani, sobon su shina Yesu yi abenshi mu a kiya asu la. sede sua zi womba ntani.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Se su sa Yesu ndani, su saka ntani worosu a boyi de su kone Yesu kankye ntani kyakyawu, su sa dishiya de su kaa yi ni mbodaa de yaa pala de su samu sori nja dama de su la yi ba toree. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Nsu kone a boyi minya e yi: &lt;&lt;Male, mu shina nkye ka pala nja kokoyi mbode ma kyakya, ka nana sokiya ba sede ka kokoyi turiki ni Mirikisi a siki gaskye <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />E ma dede na de mu biya gendu ba keisa ko yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu shina wayo asu e gye su nkye, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Nana ni gyolo. Seni waa nja woto ni waa ma a gyolo mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Su keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Keisa,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:25">Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Ku ba keisa mbode ma ni keisa, ku ba Mirikisi mbode ma ni Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Su yi yaa de su ka Yesu a kiya beta de e pala a geba ni ntani ba. Su zi mamanki ni mbode e ma keleba su, su kuma yi shuru.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minya Beta A kiya Dege kumsha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12.18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Worosu su Sadokiyawa, de su nkye dege a kumsha ma ba, su te anya Yesu su minya yi. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Su nkye, &lt;&lt;Male,&gt;&gt; Musa rubuta mu nshi nkye nde yayiwa ake ni minzi muntu se e bila mata e yi sede e man yaya nja shi ba, nseminji dole yaala mase de minji yi muntu de e yapu yaya ba yayiwa e yi. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Kuzukam su yi woron su yayuwa bokwe, ni pari yi amere e muntu ba yaa. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ni bi e shi ma e yi amere e muntu ba yaa <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />nja ni wuku amere e yi, yomu na guru asu ntani bokwe mu muntu, ba yaya ba. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />A karishe e yi, mase ni muntu du. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kuzukam, e dege ni kumsha waa mase mu yaama mata e yi, tun de guru asu bokwe ni su amere yi?<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt;Ntani durinya mu su ma yi amere nja beyi yaya asu mata amere. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Sede worede su deta de sua zunwa nleyi siki sana nsu zo ni nja dege a kumsha osu sua yi amere ba sua la su beyi amere ba, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />sobon sua sakye muntu gagaba, sua ma kankye meleku Mirikisi. Sua ma yaya ni Mirikisi, tun de su ma yaya ni dege a kumsha la <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Sede Musa ma nana a pili a kwanki sanwa suwuta a denka nkye, worede su muntu sua dege a kumsha, e shi e sukwa Obagizi &lt;Mirikisi ni Abireyi, nja Mirikisi ni Ishaku, nja Mirikisi ni Yakubu,&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />E ma Mirikisi muntu na ba, sede e ma ni leyi la, sobon nshi guru ma ni leyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Worosu su male ni doka Musa su keleba nkye &lt;&lt;Male ki pala kyakya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nse daa sakye yi dishiya minya yi beta daa gagaba.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minya Beta A kiya Kiristi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12.35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Se Yesu gye su nkye, yaya sua nkye Kiristi ma Yaa ni dowuda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dowuda nkiya e yi pala a siki takada ni Zabura:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;&lt;Obagizi gye Obagizi na:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Zunwa a nani dama na<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />ari na saa obokigeba ake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">a kisi tapi seni ake.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dowuda sukwa yi &lt;Obagizi.&gt; Yaya na yaama yaa ni Dowuda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Pelesa Male Kokoyi Doka Musa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12.38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />De guru ntani su zi, Yesu gye yayagizi e yi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Ku yi ankeli ni male ni kokoyi doka Musa, sua zaga ni angwe dololo nja sua so de ntani su geshe su abije nja de su samu kingbolo zunwa ni girima a kolonwa nja anya zunwa kyakyawu anya buki. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Osu na su ma nsu geni dama mata makeyi de su kwa yi keyi a gizi su nja sua yi yaruwa ni yi lepa nyisa. Yiri ntani ni sua yi su poro soseyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Sedeka Mase Makeyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mk 12.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />De Yesu kone bisi, E geni nsu mbo nani sua saa sedeka a siki mbo beiko sa sedeka a laki Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Yesu kwa geni potoruwa mase makeyi e zo de sa gyolo bi piri de keyi toro kobo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesu nkye &lt;&lt;Na gye ku gaskye,&gt;&gt; Sedeka de Potoruwa makeyi mu beyi e pi ni guru ntani. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Guru ntani mu su beyi sedeka asu a siki mbo nani asu de su ma shi la; sede e shi mase makeyi mu e beyi a siki reshi mbo de e manshi de yaa zunwa ni leyi yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yi Beta A kiya Juru ni Gizi Mirikisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mat 24.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mk 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Worosu yaya gizi e yi su para yi beta a kiya laki Mirikisi de su yi gyaga nja dunsi kyakyawu nja kyawuta de su beyi ba Mirikisi. Sede Yesu gye su nkye, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Mbo de kwa geni anya mu, kwanki yaa zo de ba dunsi daa de zunwa a bisi ni daa, kowoni daa a siki asu sua la kutiri a kisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuya ni Pari</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13.3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Worosu su ntani minya Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Male,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Woni kwanki na mbo mu yaa paru? Nja mina ma alama de mwa geni kwanki de mbo worosu mu sua paru?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu keleba su nkye: &lt;&lt;Ku kone kede nse daa e shishirigye ku. Ntani Nyowa sua zo a siki seni na, sua nkye, &lt;E ni na ni ma e shi,&gt; nja, &lt;Kwanki e yi kusa.&gt; Kede ku biya su. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nde ku zi nabari yanki nja dege ankeli, kede ku zi womba. Mbo woromu dole na su paru mpari, sede karishe tuku zowo ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Se Yesu gye su: &lt;&lt;Arishiya daa sua yi geba nja arishiya daa, nja solota geri daa sua yi geba nja solota geri daa, <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Sua yi mumungu zizika kesa, sua yi nyunwa nja aloba a kowoni anga, Mbo womba yaa paru nja totore alama yaa butu a bisi.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;Sede kapi guru mbo mu, sua ka ku nja ba ku Genbeki. Sua la ku beyi a kolonwa nja jaru, sua zo ku a geba seleki nja kamkiya, guru sobon ni seni na. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Damu yaama dama ba ku de kwa beyi sheeda nabari kyakyawu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Sede ku saa dishiya aku kede ku da mu yiri de kwa tele kiya ku. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Na gye ku beta de kwa pala nja shina de nse daa a siki oboki geba aku sua yi yaa ki ko su yi musu ni mbode ku pala. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Sua butu ku a beyi ko nsu adaa aku, yayuwa aku, nsu gizi aku nja oboki aku, nja sua kisa worosu su aku. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Guru ntani sua ki ku sobon seni na. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Sede ba gesa ni kiya aku daa de yaa beta ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ku sakisi nsori kwa sila nkiya ke.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Pala Yiride Wurishelima Yaa Juru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mat 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mk 13.14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />&lt;&lt;Nde ku geni Wurishelima gyowe ni shoja, kwa shina nkye juru e yi kusa. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Se worede su ma Yawudiya su yi gudu ta kiya ogbo, worede su ma totolo geri su butu a woze, nja worede su ma kesa daa kede su yuru atotolo geri. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Da mu ma kwanki ni poro, sobon dole guru mbode e ma rubuta a siki takada Mirikisi e sika . <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Gbotuma aku mata nsu siki nja mata nsu goyi yaya a kwanki ni! sua yi mumungu wuya a kesa nja anwashi ni Mirikisi a kiya ni ntani. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Sua kisa ntani worosu ayanki sua kaa worosu nta yaya jaru te bowuta a guru worosu kesa. Worede su shina Mirikisi ba sua taka Wurishelima kapi de kwanki worede shina Mirikisi ba e sika.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zo ni Yaa Nsebeki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13.24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;Mwa kwa geni alama yaa nana a siki naana, wonta nja kemu. A siki durinya, worede su shina Mirikisi ba sua sha Genbeki nja rikishe sobon womba zizika ni tonsa totolo riki nja dege mbo de riki mma yi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ntani sua lense muntu sobon womba ni mbode yaa paru a durinya, sori ni agida gida bisi yaa zizika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />A kwanki ni sua geni yaa nsebeki yaa zo dege a gidagida ni sori nja totolo girima e yi. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Nde mbo woromu para paru, dege kiya aku a bisi, sobon pushe aku e yi kusa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kokoyi A kiya Ntasi Bori</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13.28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu gye su abenshi mu nkye: &lt;&lt;Ku kone ntasi bori nja guru ntasi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Nde su para butu genya, oku nkiya aku ku shina ndamina yi kusa. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Nzun yomu, nde ku geni mbo worosu mu sua paru, ku shina nkye solota ni gizi Mirikisi e yi kusa.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />&lt;&lt;Na gye ku gaskye, ntani kuzum kam sua taba muntu ba se guru mbo worosu mu paru. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Bisi nja kisi sua bise, sede beta na yaa taba bise ba.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Showura A kiya Zunwa Nshiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;Ku zunwa ni shiri, kede kusa dishiya aku a kiya mbosi si nja sha nja damuwa ni durinya su dama dishiya aku, mba yomu ba, nana ni yaa zo de ku shina ba kankye toroko. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Yaa zo a kiya guru ntani durinya kankye toroko. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ku sa ndani kone kowon nana nja yi lepa sobon de ku sila dege guru mbode yaa paru, nja de ku sakisi a geba ni yaa nsebeki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kowoni nana Yesu yaa kokoyi a laki Mirikisi, se kowoni nyema yaa te kwana a kiya totolo dunsi de sua sukwa zetu, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />se guru ntani sua zo anya e yi nsasape de su zi yi a laki Mirikisi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Toree Yawudawa Su yi Showura de Su Kisa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />De kwanki buki mbo si ni darigaza de sua sukwa yi buki yenteri, e yi kusa, <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Se toree ni pirisi nja male ni doka Musa sua bila turiki de su ka Yesu, sede sua yi womba ni ntani.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yawuda Yeda De butu Yesu A beyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mk 14.10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Se obiri yuru Yawuda, de sua sukwa yi nkye Isikariyoti, daa a siki gom sha bi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Se Yawuda te anya tolense pirisi nja totore ni nsu kone laki Mirikisi su yi showura yiri de yaa butu Yesu a beyi su. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Se Su yi peri siki, nja su yeda de su beyi gyolo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Se Yawuda yeda, e kwa bila turiki butu Yesu a beyi ba su anya de yowa ntani ma ba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Si mbosi ni Nyeteri nja yayagizi e yi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13.21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />De e keyi nana de sua buki ni buredi nsu yisti ba, ka yi de timshiya ni yenteri sua la beyi sedeka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu saka Biturusu nja Yaaya nkye, &lt;&lt;Te de ku yi shiri ni mbosi yenteri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Angana na ka bila de mu shiriya yi?&gt;&gt; su minya. <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Na keleba nkye, &lt;&lt;Nde ku yuru a geri, kwa gomu nseminji daa keyi tuni riki. Ku biya yi te gizi de yaa yuru a shi, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />De ku gye nsu gizi, male minya: &lt;Angana ma laki de Eni nja yayagizi na mua si mbosi ni nyenteri?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Yaa nana ku laki bisi totolo, guru gyala. ku yi shiriya mbosi anya ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />De su te su geni Mbo guru ma Yiride Yesu Pala gye su. Se su shiriya mbosi ni yenteri.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jibi ni Obagizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />De kwanki ka yi, Yesu nja yaya manki yi zunwa akigbolo. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Se Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt; E ni ma memeri de ni si mbosi ni yenteri nja ku kapi de E ni sha Genbeki. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Eni ma gye ku, Eni ma kara si mbosi meteri nja ku jaja ba se su sika maana yi a solota ni Mirikisi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />A beyi de la koshiya riki ntasi inebi, e gbede Mirikisi nja e pala, &lt;&lt;Ku la de ku laba ba nkiya ku. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Du E ni ma gye ku E ni ma kara sha gagaba dege yaya ni ntasi mu ba se solota ni Mirikisi pelesa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Se la buredi, e gbede Mirikisi e sua, se ba su, e pala nkye, &lt;&lt;Nsu mu ma nki na de ni ba ku, ku yi yomu de ku turunwa ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ari yomu, a beyi si mbosi na la koshiya, nkye, &lt;&lt;koshiya mu ma ni sabuwa ni anikowori ni zini na, de yaa nya a woze sobon nku. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Sede nani nsu de yaa butu ni a beyi yaa si mbosi nja ni. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Yaa nsebeki yaa te yiride su rubuta pala e kiya yi, sede gbotuma ni su de butu yi a beyi. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Su para minya nkya su waa na yaa yi mbo mumungu mu yomu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musu A kiya Waa ma Tolense</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Se musu dege saka ni yayagizi Yesu a kiya waa na ma tolense. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Seleki ni worede su shina Mirikisi ba sua nana yiko a kiya ntani su, worede sua nana yiko a kiya su sukwa kiya su nsu toree. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Sede oku kede ma a sisika ku yomu ba! sede, tolense a siki ku e shi ma kankye yaa dende, nsude ma kamkiya ku sede e shi ma kankye bunwa ku. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Du nsude ma tolense, nsude yaa zunwa kingbolo de si mbosi ko nsude ma yaa beyi mbosi la? nsude zunwa a kingbolo bo? sede Eni ma a sisika ku ma bawuta ku kankye daa nsude ma bunwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Oku na ku ma worede su sakisi nja ni a siki Genbeki na. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Yiride Adaa na ba ni yiko ni solota, yomu eni man ni ba ku. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />sobon de ku si nja ku sha a kingbolo ni solota na nja zunwa a kingbolo ni solota, na ku yi shiriya ni zuriya gom sha bi ni Izireyila.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu Yi Musu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />&lt;&lt;Yesu nkye, Sima, Sima, obiri yaa bila dama de gwada ku kankye nsu bikiya yaa laba alikama. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Sede E ni yi ku lepa, de beigaskye ku yaa puari ba. Nde ki sakisi ka ba yayuwa ke sori guyam.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Sede Biturusu keleba, &lt;&lt; Obagizi ni ma ashiri de ni te nja ke a jaru nja ko ni muntu. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu nkye Na gye ke, Biturusu, kapi zakala yi kara yawumu, ka yi musu shina ni sen wuku.<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku gyala Nkiku Sobon Kwanki Wuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu minya yayagizi e yi, de Ni saka ku ba gyolo. Angala, ko takalami ku lesa mbodaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Su keleba nkye mbodaa ba.<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu gye ku, &lt;&lt;Sede kuzukam nde ki te ma gyolo, la e yi,nja Angala; nja nde ki ma obalaba ba, la riga se de ki see daa. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Du su rubuta takada ni Mirikisi nkye, su se ni a siki nsu lepi &gt;&lt;Eni ma gye ku guru mbode su rubuta e kiya na yaa sika.<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />yayagizi su pala, Obagizi, kone! mu ma obalaba bi. &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">&lt;&lt; Yesu keleba su, beta mu adenta yomu.<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Yi lepa A kiya Ogbo Ni Zetu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14.32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu bila anya ni na e te ogbo dunsi ni zetu, yiride e saba yi nja yayagizi yi biya yi te nja shi anya ni. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />De a zo anya ni, Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;ku yi lepa de Mirikisi a sua ku nto de kede ku puari a siki gwada. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Yesu butu anya su te a geba piri na dure a kisi na yi lepa, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Adaa, nde ki yeda, de ni sha koshiya mu, nupi na ba, sede na ke la e paru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Meleku Mirikisi dege bisi zo anya yi de ja yi sori. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />De Yesu ma siki Genbeki, e yi lepa soseyi, se awuriji yi nya kisi ma kankye zini.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />De Yesu dege anya yi lepa kuma beyi ta anya yayagizi yi, e san su sua yi kwana, dun sua yi bekisiki. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yesu minya su nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina saa kwa yi kwana?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ku dege a bisi de ku yi lepa kede ku puari a siki gwada.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Kaa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jn 18.3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />De Yesu ma a siki beta ntani zo anya yi, se nseminji de sua sukwa yi Yawuda, daa a siki yayagizi e yi gom sha bi, biya ni su. E zo anya Yesu zo runguma yi, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />sede Yesu minya Yawuda nkye, &lt;&lt;Yawuda, ni runguma na ka butu yaa nsebeki a beyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />De yayagizi Yesu geni mbode yaa paru, su nkye, Obagizi, mu sala ni obalaba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Se daa a siki yayagizi Yesu za kusa yanka daa a siki bunwa tolense ni pirisi. E yanka yi kuni dama. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Sede Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Ku bila kede ku yi yomu ba!&gt;&gt; Yesu kpa kuni yaa minzi ni e worikye yi <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yesu gye tolense ni pirisi, salaki nsu kone laki Mirikisi, nja toree geri worede su zo anya yi, &lt;&lt;Yesu gye su nkye, Ni ma nsu ki zi na, de ku kwa yi ntani zo anya ni obalaba nja gwala? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kowon nana ni ma nja ku a siki laki Mirikisi. Ku ka ni ba. Sede da mu ma kwanki ku la, de sori dopuwa sua yi solota.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturusu yi Musu Shina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mat 26.57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mk 14.53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jn 18.12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Na su ka Yesu, su te nshi a gizi ni tolense pirisi. Biturusu ta biya su nyisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Na su wula wuta a sisika papada gizi shiriya na e zunwa gabada, Biturusu zunwa nja su. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />bunwa mase geni yi zunwa anya ni ni asikye wuta. Bunwa mase kone. Na pala nkye,&lt;&lt;nseminji mu ma nja Yesu du. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Biturusu e musu nkye. &lt;&lt;Mase, eni ma ni shina yi ba, e shi pala.<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />E beyi piri yomu nseminji daa geni yi, &lt;&lt;nkye eke ma ki ma daa nja shi du!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">&lt;&lt; Biturusu keleba nkye, nseminji, Eni shina yi ba <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />A beyi keripi daa nseda kwa zo pala nkye, &lt;&lt;Nseminji mu ma nja Yesu la, sobon ema nsu galiliya la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Biturusu keleba, &lt;&lt; nseminji, Eni shina mbode ka pala ba!&gt;&gt;dandani de a tuku ma a kiya beta, zakala yi kara. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Na Obagizi juyi na kone Biturusu ndani tiriri, anya ni Biturusu turunwa ni beta de Obagizi e pala: &lt;&lt; kapi zakala yi kara ka yi musu shina ni nsum wuku.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Biturusu butu te a woze na e yi kuka ni bekisiki soseyi<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su yi Yesu Siya Nja Dukwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26.67</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mk 14.65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />worede sua kpanku Yesu su yi siya nja dukwa yi. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Su ripe yi ndani nja su minya yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Yi aneshi waa dukwa ke!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nja su kwa gye basi ni worosu mumungu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Ka yi Yesu Zo A geba ni Toree</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jn 18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />De anya ku yi nsasape salaki geri, guru nsu tolense pirisi nja male ni doka Musa, su gomu, nja na su keyi Yesu zo a geba su <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />&lt;&lt;Gye mu,&gt;&gt; su nkye nde eke na ki ma kiristi,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu keleba, &lt;&lt; Nde Eni gye ku, kwa taba beigaskye ni ba, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Nde Eni minya ku, kwa yi yaa keleba ni ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Sede dege kuzukam zo a geba kwa geni yaa nsebeki yaa zuzunwa anya dereja Mirikisi nsude pi sori.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Se guru asu su minya, &lt;&lt;Eke na ki ma yaa ni Mirikisi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">E keleba, &lt;&lt;ku pala nkye Eni ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Anya ni su gye kiya su, woni sheeda mu bila jaja? mu rigye zi dege bakiyi. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu A geba Bilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mat 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18.28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Se guru ntani dege la Yesu te nshi anya Bilatu <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Se su para sua yaruwa ja Yesu, &lt;&lt;Mu geni nseminji mu yaa dege a ankeli ni ntani kesa mu, yaa nana su beyi gendu ba Kesar nja yaruwa nkye e ma kiristi, seleki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Se Bilatu minya Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;E ke na ki ma seleki ni ntani yawudawa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu keleba nkye &lt;&lt;Yomuna, yiride ki pala,&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Se Bilatu gye tolense pirisi nja guru ntani, &lt;&lt;Ni geni mbo da de ma ni lepi nja ni mungu anya e yi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Sede su masa soseyi, &lt;&lt;E shi yaa rikishe ntani guru ni Yawudiya ni mbo de yaa kokoyi. E para yiri Galili ari samu turiki zo anya mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Keyi Yesu ta Geba Yiridu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />De Bilatu zi yomu, e minya nkye yaa minji mu ma Galiliya na.? <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />De Bilatu shina nkye Yesu ma gunduma kesa ni Yiridu, e kiri Yesu te ba seleki Yiridu, de ma a Wurishelima a kwanki ni.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />De seleki Yiridu geni Yesu, se e jima yi soseyi, sobon e la kwanki yaa pekye de e geni Yesu de shina ko waa ma e shi. Sobon mbode yaa zi a kiya yi, yaa sadishiya de geni alama daa anya yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Yiridu minya yi mbo nyowa, sede Yesu keleba e yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Se Tolense ni pirisi nja male ni doka Musa su sakisi anya ni, sua pala yaruwa a kiya e yi. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Se Yiridu nja shoja e yi su wulakanshi yi se su yi siya. su sayi totolo riga seleki, su sa yi kuma te aya ni Bilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />A nana ni Yiridu nja Bilatu su kuma ma oboki, kapi mbo mu paru su ma oboki geba la.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18.39—19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatu sukwa toree pirisi gomu, salaki nja ntani, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Se Bilatu minya su nkye, &lt;&lt;Ku zo ni nseminji mu a kiya de ku nkye yaa rikishe ntani. Ni gwada a geba aku sede ni sa nshi ni lepi de kwa pala a kiya yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ko Yiridu ma, de kuma nshi zo anya mu, yiri de ku geni, e yi mbode deta de muntu ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />nkaa yomu, Na poro yi de ni shika yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Akwanki buki nyenteri dole na Bilatu e butu nseda yiri jaru ba su. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ni murinya daa su yi kuruwa, &lt;&lt;Ku te nseminji mu! suwo yi! ku shika mu baraba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />&lt;Baraba e shina ma nsu de su sayi a jaru ni lepi rikishi de su yi a kesa, nja kisa nse de su yi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Se Bilatu sakye yi su beta de e shika Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Sede su sigeba ni kuruwa, &lt;&lt;Gidiri e yi! Gidiri e yi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bilatu yi beta nja su ni sen wuku nkye: &lt;&lt;Yaya? Lepi mina nseminji mu yi? Ni sa nshi ni lepi daa de deta muntu ba. nkaa yomu Na poro yi de ni shika yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Sede su sakisi nsori su dama Bilatu de e bila Yesu ba su de su gidiri yi, a karishe su yi nasara. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Se Bilatu yeda de yi mbode su ologba yi de yi su nshi. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Se Bilatu shika baraba de su sayi a jaru ni lepi rikishe geri ni reshi zi nja kisa ntani. Sede e shika su Yesu de su yi mbode sua bila de su yi.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su Gidiri Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />De su la Yesu te nshi, se su gomu nja sima nseminji Sayiri, e butu dege dende geri daa, se su sayi la gidiri de biya Yesu a beyi.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="f" />Se ntani nyowa biya yi, nja mata worede sua yi kuka ni beki siki a kiya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu juyi gye su nkye, yaya mata ni Wurishelima, kede ku yi ni kuka; ku yi kuka sobon kiya ku nja yaya ku. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Sede kwanki yaa zo de kwa nkye, &lt;Anabirika ma nja mata de su taba yapu ba, nja nsude taba ka yi siki ba, nja worede su taba ba yaya nono ba!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Sede a kwanki mu na,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ntani sua gye dunsi, &lt;&lt;Ku puari ja mu a kiya!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">Sua kwa gye ogbo nkye, &lt;&lt;Ripe mu!&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Nde ntani su ma yi yomu nja ntasi de ma nyala, mina yaa paru nde e kyekeri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Su keyi worosu ntani bi bolowa, te de su kisa su nja Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />De su zo anya de sua sukwa yi kwankwa kiya, anya ni su gidiri Yesu, nja nsu lepi bi mu daa ma a nani dama daa ma a nani guni. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Se Yesu nkye, &lt;&lt;Adaa na yape su, sobon su shina mbode su ma yi ba.&gt;&gt; Se su laba riga yi ba nkiasu de su kutiri kuriya<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Ntani sakisi su ma kone yi, toree geri su yi siya. Su nkye &lt;&lt;E sila worosu; bila de e sila nkiya yi nde e shi na ma kiristi de Mirikisi zabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />shoja ma su zo yi siya. Su ma mika yi riki ni inebi de musha <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Su ma nkye,&lt;&lt;Nde ki ma seleki Yawudawa, sila kiya ke.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A bisi kiya yi su rubuta, karatu nkye,&lt;&lt;DAMU NA MA SELEKI YAWUDAWA&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />daa siki nsu lepi de su gidiri yi nja Yesu, yi Yesu beta nene nkye: &lt;&lt;Eke na ki ma kiristi bo? sila kiya ke nja mu maana!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Sede nseminji ni bi kwabe yi nkye, &lt;&lt;ka yi womba Mirikisi bo? &gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Eke de ki sa mu poro lepi kyakya na yi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Omu de kyakya na su yi mu, Sobon mu ma keleba nani wuta mbode mu yi na. Sede yaa minji mu yi lepi mbodaa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Se nkye,&lt;&lt;Yesu turunwa ni, nde ki zo kingbolo solota ake.<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu keleba yi nkye, &lt;&lt;Mma gye ke gaskye yawumu ka ma nja ni a siki solota gizi bisi.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Sede kyakya keripi gomu sha bi dopuwa ripe guru kesa ari keripi wuku ni nyema; <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />nana bila asikye. Na labile de ma a siki gizi Mirikisi laba bi.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Se Yesu dege murinya nsori yi kuruwa nkye, &lt;&lt; Adaa na! A siki nani ke na ni munka aworo na.&gt;&gt; De Yesu pala yomu se e muntu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />De totolo shoja Roma de ma anya ni geni mbode paru, e yobo Mirikisi nkye, &lt;&lt;Gaskye nseminji mu ma nse gangasi la!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />De ntani de su tala anya ni de kone su geni mbode paru, se guru asu su kuma te a gizi su ma buga geba ni bekisiki. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Guru worede su shina Yesu, nja mata de su biya yi dege Galili, su sakisi nyisa su ma kone.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bishina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Nseminji daa nsu seni Yusupu, dege geri ni Arimatiya ni yawudawa, ema kiriki nja ema nse gangasi la, de ma pekye zo ni solota Mirikisi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Nseminji daa seni ma Yusupu dege Arimatiya, a kesa Yawuda. E ma nse kyakyawu la, ema a siki nsu pekye solota ni Mirikisi. Kode ema daa na a siki toree ni kunji yawudawa, sede E yeda ni mbode toree su shiriya de su yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Se e te nja Bilatu, de e minya yi de su beyi nki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Se e sonka ni nki Yesu, e ripe yi ni woriki, e la yi sa a kumsha de su yanka a nki dunsi de su taba sa nseda asiki yi ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ema nana asibi na, e rigye piri de a yuru a nana pushe, de nana asibi.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Mata de su zo nja Yesu dege Galili biya Yusupu de su geni anya de kumsha nja anya de su sa nki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Se su te gizi de su shiriya meyi kemeshi nja keyi kemeshi sobon nki Yesu. Su pushe a nana asibi kankye yiride doka Musa pala.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Dege ni Yesu a kumsha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />A nana ladi mbaki nsasape, mata woroni la keikei kemeshi de su shiriya su te a kumsha. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Se su geni su rigye kiri dunsi bila baki kumsha, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Su yuru a siki, sede su geni nki Obagizi Yesu ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />De su ma a siki tunani a kiya mbode paru, dandani menza bi sakisi ni keyi peri de mayi asikye kusa nsu. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Mata a siki womba su ripe ndani a kisi, sede menza gye su, &lt;&lt;Mina sa kwa bila nsu leyi a siki nsu muntu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Yesu ma anya mu ba; e rigye dege! Turunwa mbode gye ku, kwanki de e ma nja ku a Galili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />&lt;Nkye Yaa nsebeki sua la yi beyi a nani nsu lepi, sua kisa yi, sua gidiri yi sede a nana ni wuku yaa dege jaja&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Se mata woroni turunwa ni kelima Yesu de gye su.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />De su kuma beyi dege kumsha, su pala guru mbo woromu nja yayagizi Yesu gom sha daa nja guru ririgye ntani. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Mata worede gye yaya manki Yesu mbode paru osu na ma, Meremu dege Magadaliya, Yuwana, nja Meremu amaa ni Yakubu, nja worosu mata ma nja su. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Sede nsu yayagizi Yesu yeda mbode mata woromu su pala ba, dun su la beta su ma mbodaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Sede Biturusu, dege a bisi yi gudu ta kumsha, e bwala leka kumsha, se e geni woriki peri de su lende gan a siki kumsha, Biturusu te mayi, yi mamanki a kiya ni mbode paru.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A Turiki ni Emawus</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12">Mk 16.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />A nana ni yayagizi Yesu bi su te a geri nsu seni Emawus, de nyisa yi ma meli bokwe kyakya dege Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Su yi beta nja nkiasu a kiya mbode paru guru. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />De su ma a kiya beta nja nkiasu a kiya mbode paru, se Yesu ja kusa su se e para tepiya nja su; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />sede su shina nta Yesu na mayi tepiya nja su ba.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu minya su, &lt;&lt;Beta mina ku mayi nja nkiyaku kuma yi tepiya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Su sakisi ship, pisika asu nana bashi la yi. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Se daa a siki asu, seni yi ma kilobas, minya yi, eke dandaa ki ma bakwe de shina mbode paru a Wurishelima a kwanamu bo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu minya su nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina paru?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Su keleba nkye&lt;&lt;Mbo mu paru a kiya Yesu anebi yiri Nazere,&gt;&gt; De mani kelima nja ANKI girima anya Mirikisi nja guru ntani. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Sede toree pirisi nja nsu shiriya mu su la yi beyi ba nsu yiko Roma de su kisa yi, se su gidiri yi; <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />mu sadishiya nkye e shi na ma nsu de yaa sila ni Izireyila yiri oboki gaba su. a beyi da mu, kwana wuku amu de guru mbo mu paru. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kara a kiya beta mu, worosu mata a siki keshi amu su ba mu mamanki. Su te a kumsha mbaki sasape. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />sede su sani gaga nki yi Yesu anya ni ba, Su zo gye mu nkye su geni worosu meleku a siki waayi, de su pala nkye e man leyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Se worosu su a siki amu dege te a kumsha su geni yi ba, yiri de mata woromu pala geni mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Se Yesu minya su nkye, &lt;&lt;Mina sa ku ma shina ba yomu, nja mina sa ku ma dishiya seberi ni beigaskye ni guru mbode anebi pala ba! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />E ma dole na de kiristi e sha Genbeki mbo worosu mu bo? Dege anya ni yaa kwa yuru a siki ni girima e yi bo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Se Yesu para gye su beta dege kiya Musa nja guru anebi, ni mbode su rubutu a takada Mirikisi kiya e yi.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />De su kusa ni dende geri de sua te, Yesu yi kankye yaa bise te a geba. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Sede su masa e yi soseyi, &lt;&lt;kwana anya mu nja mu, dun nana yaa bila yaa anya yi dopuwa kuzukam;.&gt;&gt; Se Yesu te de e kwakwana nja su.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />De su zuzunwa de su si mbo si, Yesu la buredi, e gbede mirikisi e yi lepa e watala yi e para ba su. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Se ndani asu bure se su shina yi, se Yesu beta te mayi bila su. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Se su minya nkiya su, &lt;&lt;Dishiya amu yaa suwuta kankye wuta a siki mu ba? de yaa yi beta nja mu de mua yi tepiya a turiki de yaa gye mu beta a takada mirikisi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Su dege a bisi dandani na su kuma te a Wurishelima. Anya ni su san yaya manki gom sha daa nja worosu su, geba daa, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Se yaya manki pala nkye, &lt;&lt;E ma gaskye! Obagizi dege ari e nana kiya nja Sima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Na ntani bi mu pala mbode paru su a turiki, yiri de su shina Yesu aya de keriya buredi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Butu Ta Ayan Yayagizi e yi Nkye Selema ku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ank 1.6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />De bi ma a siki beta a kiya mbomu, Yesu nkiya sakisi a sisika su e gye su, &lt;&lt;Selema e ma nja ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Womba ka su na sua kakada, su tunani su geni potoruwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Se Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Mina sa dishiya basi, mina sa ku yi shaka a dishiya ku? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Ku kone nani na nja seni naa. E ni nkiya na la! ku kpa ni nani na de ku geni; potoruwa mani nki nja keshi ba, nta yiride ku geni niman shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />De e gama pala yomu e nana su nani e yi nja seni yi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Se tunde su tuku yeda nshi woba sobon perisiki nja mamanki, Yesu minya su, &lt;&lt;ku mani mbodaa anya mu ni si?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Su beyi gunda de su dobo, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yesu la suku a geba asu.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Se Yesu gye su, &lt;&lt;Da mu e shiya ma mbode Ni gye ku tunde ni ma nja ku e ma dole na e sika mbode su rubuta a kiya na a doka Musa, ni anebi nja zabura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Na Yesu bure dishiya su de su gane takada Mirikisi de su rubuta a kiya yi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Se gye su, mbode su rubuta mu: nkye kiristi yaa sha Genbeki nja yaa dege a kumsha a nana wuku, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />de sua beyi manki ni juyi nja yape ni lepi a siki seni e yi guru durinya, sua para dege Wurishelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Ku ma sheeda ni guru mbo worosu mu de paru. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Yesu gye su nkye Na saka ku mbode adaa na yi anikowori; sede ku pekye a totolo geri tuku de yiko dege bisi yaa sonka a kiya ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Su La Yesu Ta Bisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16.19</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ank 1.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />De Yesu kwa yi su te a beyi geri Betani, e dege nani a bisi sa su anabirika. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />De Yesu ma kiya sa su anabirika, e dege bila su se su la yi te siki bisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Se su bowuta yi su kuma te Wurishelima ni perisiki nyowa. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Se su sigeba ni ma laki Mirikisi kowon nana sua yobo Mirikisi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>